// This Pine Script® code is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License 2.0
// at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
// Copyright (C) 2022 Saty Mahajan
// Original open-source script: Saty ATR Levels, TradingView user satymahajan
// Derivative work © EMA34TRADER
// Kept from Saty: prior-period close ± ATR fib map, period selector,
// "Use Current Close", and the 8-21-34 ribbon color on the small info table.
// Added here: session and signal engine, confirmed-close entries and exits,
// Golden Gate / trigger-pullback / 10m EMA8 / first-hour PDC-reclaim markers,
// mode presets, scoped historical percentages, dashboard, legend, and alerts.
//
// Not financial advice. Visible percentages describe one past SPY regular-hours
// sample (3-minute confirmed closes, Day period, 2000-2025). They are not a
// forecast and they hide outside that exact scope.
//
// =============================================================================
// v2026-08-31 -- Pine v6 public-library preparation.
// Milkman entry, exit, level and probability RULES are unchanged.
// =============================================================================
// Compliance and compiler changes only:
//  1. Pine Script version 6. dynamic_requests=false keeps the v5 request.*
//     context behaviour for the daily levels and the 10m / 1h series.
//  2. Title shortened for TradingView public-script rules (English, ASCII, no hype).
//  3. Header credits Saty Mahajan and states what was kept vs added.
//  4. Mode label no longer says "research-backed".
//
// Prior audit notes still apply:
//  1. Simple Mode no longer hides 38.2%. 38.2% and 61.8% always draw.
//  2. Cross reference follows the SIGNAL SESSION, not a hardcoded cash session.
//  3. Trigger labels read the actual trigger input.
//  4. Daily reset follows the signal session.
//  5. "First hour" is 60 minutes from the session start.
//  6. Alert messages are mechanics-only.
//  7. Timeframe degradation is detected; 10m/1h features suppress above those TFs.
//  8. Entry/exit asymmetry with a buffer is stated on the chart.
//  9. Symbol scope is an exact match -- SPYG does not inherit SPY stats.
// 10. Milkman preset forces the Day level period.
// 11. MODE row is a single compact line.
// 12. Extension levels are plotted, not just labelled.
// 13. PDC reclaim figures appear in text.
// 14. EMAs, runner target and alert toggles live under their own groups.
// 15. 10m EMA8 pullback requires the Gate to have opened.
// =============================================================================
//@version=6
indicator("Trinity ATR Levels", shorttitle="Trinity ATR Levels", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=200, dynamic_requests=false)

// ════════════════════════════①MODE ════════════════════════════
// The option labels carry the difference, so it is visible without opening the
// tooltip. The tooltip carries the reasoning.
P_MILK = 'MILKMAN  ·  SPY/SPX only  ·  3m  ·  scoped historical stats'
P_UNIV = 'UNIVERSAL  ·  any market & timeframe  ·  no statistics'
P_CUST = 'CUSTOM  ·  my own rules'

preset = input.string(P_MILK, 'Mode',
     options=[P_MILK, P_UNIV, P_CUST],
     tooltip='WHAT THE THREE MODES CHANGE\n' +
     'The levels are identical in all three. What differs is when a signal may fire, how often it may re-fire, and whether probabilities are shown at all.\n\n' +
     '──MILKMAN ──\n' +
     'The researched configuration, followed as closely as the published studies allow: 3-minute confirmed closes, regular trading hours, one entry per direction per day, no entry buffer, daily levels from the regular session.\n' +
     'Probabilities are displayed, because this is the only configuration they were measured in: SPY, regular hours, 3-minute closes, 2000-2025. Put the chart on anything other than SPY or SPX and they hide themselves.\n' +
     'Use this if you want the published SPY regular-hours configuration.\n\n' +
     '──UNIVERSAL ──\n' +
     'The same levels and the same trigger / Golden Gate structure, on any market and any timeframe: crypto, FX, futures, single stocks. Signals run around the clock because a 24-hour market has no cash session to gate against, re-entries are unlimited with a longer cooldown, and a 1% ATR entry buffer filters the extra noise of less liquid instruments.\n' +
     'Probabilities are hidden entirely. Not because the structure fails elsewhere -- ATR levels are used across every market -- but because nobody has measured the hit rates outside SPY. Showing SPY numbers on BTC would be inventing evidence.\n' +
     'Use this anywhere that is not SPY or SPX.\n\n' +
     '──CUSTOM ──\n' +
     'Every setting under "Signal Rules" applies. Nothing is forced. Statistics follow the scope switch in that group.\n' +
     'Use this once you know which specific rule you want to change and why.')

p_milk = preset == P_MILK
p_univ = preset == P_UNIV
p_cust = preset == P_CUST


// ════════════════════════════②LEVELS ════════════════════════════
day_trading      = 'Day'
multiday_trading = 'Multiday'
swing_trading    = 'Swing'
position_trading = 'Position'
longterm_trading = 'Long-term'

trading_type_in = input.string(day_trading, 'Level Period',
     options=[day_trading, multiday_trading, swing_trading, position_trading, longterm_trading],
     tooltip='Which higher timeframe the levels are built from. Day uses the daily ATR and the previous daily close; the others build the identical structure from weekly, monthly, quarterly or yearly bars.\n\n' +
     'FORCED TO DAY in the Milkman mode -- daily levels are what the research measured, and the probabilities mean nothing against a weekly or monthly ATR.\n\n' +
     'WORTH KNOWING (Universal and Custom modes): the higher periods turn this into a swing-trading tool rather than a day-trading one. Swing and Position build the triggers and the Golden Gate from monthly and quarterly ranges, which on liquid instruments -- large-cap equities, index ETFs, major FX pairs, the big futures contracts -- gives genuinely useful multi-week structure. Read them as levels to trade around rather than as intraday signals, and use a chart timeframe to match: a 4-hour or daily chart suits monthly levels far better than a 3-minute one.\n\n' +
     'Where it works less well: thinly traded small-cap crypto. Those markets can move several ATRs in a session and then sit dead for weeks, so a monthly or quarterly ATR produces levels either far out of reach or already blown through. Stick to the daily period on those, or to the more liquid pairs.',
     group='② Levels')
atr_length = input.int(14, 'ATR Length', minval=1, group='② Levels')
trigger_percentage = input.float(0.236, 'Trigger (share of ATR)', step=0.001, minval=0.01, maxval=1.0,
     tooltip='Where the entry gate sits either side of the previous close, as a fraction of the ATR. 0.236 is the researched value. Every label reads this input, so changing it will not leave stale text behind.',
     group='② Levels')
session_mode_in = input.string('Regular (RTH)', 'PDC / ATR Session',
     options=['Regular (RTH)', 'Extended'],
     tooltip='Regular: the previous official cash-session close and the regular-hours ATR. Extended: the previous extended-session print.\nSet by the mode -- Regular for Milkman, Extended for Universal, since 24-hour markets have no cash session.',
     group='② Levels')
use_current_close = input.bool(false, 'Use the Forming Period Close  (Saty "Use Current Close")',
     tooltip='WHICH CLOSE THE LEVELS ARE BUILT FROM\n' +
     'Every level is the reference close plus or minus a fraction of ATR. This chooses which close that is. It comes from Saty Mahajan\'s original ATR Levels and is genuine to the system -- but it is a planning tool, not a trading one.\n\n' +
     '──OFF (default, and correct for trading) ──\n' +
     'The PREVIOUS completed period\'s close and ATR. On a Day period that is yesterday\'s official close. The levels are fixed before the session starts and do not move all day, which is the entire point: you decide where the trigger and the Golden Gate are before price gets there.\n\n' +
     '──ON ──\n' +
     'The FORMING period\'s close and ATR -- on a Day period, the live price. The levels rebuild on every tick and drift with price.\n\n' +
     'WHEN TO TURN IT ON\n' +
     'In the last minutes of a session, or after hours, the forming close is effectively the final close -- so switching it on previews where tomorrow\'s levels will sit. Note them down, then switch it back off. That is the only use.\n\n' +
     'WHY IT DOES NOT WORK DURING A SESSION\n' +
     'If the reference close is the current price, price sits exactly on it by definition, permanently. The trigger boxes are defined as price being between the previous close and a trigger, so they can never be true. The Gate cannot open, the trigger cannot fire, and the whole entry engine goes inert.\n' +
     'Historically it is worse than inert: each past day\'s levels get drawn from that same day\'s close, which is look-ahead. Any pattern you think you see in the history is manufactured by the setting.\n\n' +
     'AND THE STATISTICS\n' +
     'Every Milkman study assumes levels locked to the prior daily close. With this ON, none of the percentages apply -- leave it OFF in the Milkman mode.',
     group='② Levels')

// FIX 10: the research used daily levels, so Milkman forces them.
trading_type = p_milk ? day_trading : trading_type_in
session_mode = p_cust ? session_mode_in : p_milk ? 'Regular (RTH)' : 'Extended'


// ════════════════════③SIGNAL RULES (Custom mode only) ════════════════════
signal_tf_in = input.string('Strict 3m (Milkman)', 'Signals Fire On',
     options=['Strict 3m (Milkman)', 'Any chart timeframe'],
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nStrict 3m: signals only on a 3-minute chart, which is what the research measured.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
signal_session_in = input.string('Regular hours only', 'Signals Active During',
     options=['Regular hours only', 'Premarket + regular hours', 'Every bar (24h markets)'],
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nDecided by the session clock, not by whether your chart displays extended hours. Crypto and FX need "Every bar".\nThis setting also decides where the trading day starts for entry counts and the first-hour window.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
max_entries_in = input.int(1, 'Trigger Entries Per Direction Per Session', minval=0, maxval=10,
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\n0 = unlimited. 1 = one long and one short per day, which is how the setup is traded; re-entries after a shakeout come from the T-PB, GG and EMA8 signals instead.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
cooldown_in = input.int(3, 'Re-arm Cooldown After an Exit (bars)', minval=0, maxval=50,
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nConfirmed bars that must pass after an exit before the trigger can fire again. This is what stops ENTER/EXIT flickering when price straddles the level.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
buffer_in = input.float(0.0, 'Entry Buffer Beyond Trigger (% of ATR)', minval=0.0, maxval=10.0, step=0.5,
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\n0 = the pure Milkman rule: a bare confirmed close through the level.\nAbove 0 the ENTRY must clear the trigger by that margin, but the EXIT still uses the trigger itself -- a buffer should filter which signals you take, not move your stop. That deliberately leaves a band where you are in the trade and not yet stopped; the dashboard shows both prices whenever a buffer is set.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
debounce_in = input.bool(true, 'Debounce Pullback Entries to First Touch',
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nOn: a pullback signal fires once when price first tags the level, not on every bar it lingers there.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
gapsafe_in = input.bool(true, 'Gap-Safe Cross Detection',
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nOn: the opening cross is measured against the previous session close, so an overnight gap through the trigger still produces an entry on an extended-hours chart.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')
enforce_scope_in = input.bool(true, 'Hide Statistics Outside SPY/SPX · 3m · Day · RTH',
     tooltip='IGNORED unless the mode is Custom.\nThe percentages were measured on SPY alone. Turning this off shows them everywhere, where they will be wrong.',
     group='③Signal Rules  (Custom mode only)')

signal_tf_mode = p_cust ? signal_tf_in      : p_milk ? 'Strict 3m (Milkman)' : 'Any chart timeframe'
signal_session = p_cust ? signal_session_in : p_milk ? 'Regular hours only'  : 'Every bar (24h markets)'
max_entries    = p_cust ? max_entries_in    : p_milk ? 1   : 0
cooldown_bars  = p_cust ? cooldown_in       : p_milk ? 3   : 5
buffer_pct     = p_cust ? buffer_in         : p_milk ? 0.0 : 1.0
pb_debounce    = p_cust ? debounce_in       : true
gap_safe_cross = p_cust ? gapsafe_in        : true
enforce_scope  = p_cust ? enforce_scope_in  : true


// ════════════════════════════④DISPLAY ════════════════════════════
simple_mode = input.bool(false, 'Simple Mode (essential levels only)',
     tooltip='Leaves PDC, both triggers, 38.2% and 61.8% -- the levels the system actually trades. Hides 50%, 78.6%, the extensions, previous period high/low and premarket high/low. Recommended for anyone new to ATR levels.',
     group='④ Display')
palette = input.string('Default (gold / green / red)', 'Colour Palette',
     options=['Default (gold / green / red)', 'Colour-blind safe (Okabe-Ito)'],
     tooltip='The default gold and green are hard to separate with deuteranopia or protanopia. The Okabe-Ito set stays distinguishable across the common forms of colour vision deficiency and in greyscale. It overrides the custom level colours while active.',
     group='④ Display')
dashboard_detail = input.string('Full', 'Dashboard',
     options=['Full', 'Compact', 'Off'],
     tooltip='Full: every row -- location, watch, entry, targets, stop, stall guidance, Bilbo, context, timing, distance and status.\nCompact: the six lines you actually act on -- where price is, what to do, targets, stop, Bilbo and status -- with the wording trimmed so the panel stays narrow.\nOff: no dashboard. The levels, markers and labels are unaffected.\n\nAbove a 1-hour chart both layouts drop automatically to a swing view -- location, targets, stop and distance. The intraday rows are removed rather than left saying they are inactive, because the 3-minute entry rules and the 1-hour Bilbo filter genuinely cannot be evaluated there.',
     group='④ Display')
show_milkman_table = dashboard_detail != 'Off'
compact_mode = dashboard_detail == 'Compact'
milkman_table_position = input.string('Top Right', 'Dashboard Position',
     options=['Top Left', 'Top Right', 'Bottom Left', 'Bottom Right'], group='④ Display')
milkman_table_size = input.string('Small', 'Dashboard Text Size',
     options=['Small', 'Normal', 'Large'], group='④ Display')
show_mode_row = input.bool(true, 'Dashboard: Mode Row (Full only)', group='④ Display')
show_distance_row = input.bool(true, 'Dashboard: Distance-to-Level Row (Full only)',
     tooltip='How far price sits from the trigger, 38.2% and 61.8% in price and in % of ATR, plus how far an open trade has travelled through the Golden Gate.',
     group='④ Display')
show_status_row = input.bool(true, 'Dashboard: Status Row',
     tooltip='One line that always answers "why is nothing happening" -- signals switched off, entry blocked by cooldown or budget, timeframe degradation, or simply waiting and how far away the level is.',
     group='④ Display')
show_legend = input.bool(false, 'Show Legend / Cheat Sheet',
     tooltip='A second panel explaining every level, marker and term. Switch it on when handing the chart to someone new.',
     group='④ Display')
legend_position = input.string('Bottom Left', 'Legend Position',
     options=['Top Left', 'Top Right', 'Bottom Left', 'Bottom Right'], group='④ Display')
show_info = input.bool(true, 'Show Range/ATR Info Table', group='④ Display')
table_position = input.string('Bottom Right', 'Info Table Position',
     options=['Top Right', 'Bottom Left', 'Bottom Right'], group='④ Display')
table_size = input.string('Small', 'Info Table Size', options=['Small', 'Normal', 'Large'], group='④ Display')
use_options_labels = input.bool(true, 'Use Calls/Puts Instead of Long/Short', group='④ Display')


// ════════════════════════════⑤CHART MARKERS ════════════════════════════
show_trigger_markers = input.bool(true,  'ENTER  -- confirmed close through the trigger', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_exit_markers    = input.bool(true,  'EXIT   -- confirmed close back through it', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_gg_markers      = input.bool(true,  'GG     -- Golden Gate opens at 38.2%', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_tpb_markers     = input.bool(true,  'T-PB   -- pullback to the trigger (highest EV in SPY sample)', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_ema8_markers    = input.bool(false, 'EMA8   -- pullback to the 10-minute EMA8',
     tooltip='The third-best entry by expected value, behind the trigger pullback and an immediate entry at 38.2%. Off by default because it is the busiest signal on the chart. Automatically suppressed above a 10-minute chart, where the 10m EMA cannot be read reliably.',
     group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_pdc_reclaim     = input.bool(true,  'PDC    -- first-hour reclaim of the previous close',
     tooltip='Measured on 10-minute closes inside the first hour of the session. Automatically suppressed above a 10-minute chart.',
     group='⑤ Chart Markers')
show_gg_barcolor     = input.bool(true,  'Colour the Golden Gate candle', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
gg_barcolor_mode     = input.string('Entry bar only', 'Which Bars to Colour',
     options=['Entry bar only', 'Every bar inside the Gate'], group='⑤ Chart Markers')
gg_bull_bar_in       = input.color(color.rgb(255, 200, 40), 'Bull Gate Candle', group='⑤ Chart Markers')
gg_bear_bar_in       = input.color(color.rgb(255, 160, 30), 'Bear Gate Candle', group='⑤ Chart Markers')


// ════════════════════════════⑥LEVEL COLOURS & VISIBILITY ════════════════════════════
// FIX 1: 38.2% and 61.8% are core and always draw. This flag covers only the
// secondary levels, which is what its label now says.
show_mid_ext_in = input.bool(true, 'Show 50% and 78.6%',
     tooltip='The Golden Gate boundaries (38.2% and 61.8%), both triggers and the previous close always draw -- the system cannot be read without them. This controls only the two secondary levels.',
     group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
show_ext_in = input.bool(false, 'Show Extensions Beyond ±1 ATR', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
level_size  = input.int(2, 'Level Line Thickness', minval=1, maxval=5, group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
pdc_color_in = input.color(color.white, 'Previous Close', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
trig_dn_in   = input.color(color.rgb(247, 15, 15), 'Put Trigger', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
trig_up_in   = input.color(color.rgb(63, 231, 21), 'Call Trigger', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
c382_in      = input.color(color.rgb(255, 200, 50), '38.2%  (Gate opens)', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
c500_in      = input.color(color.rgb(220, 100, 30), '50.0%  (negative EV midpoint)', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
c618_in      = input.color(color.rgb(255, 215, 0),  '61.8%  (Gate target)', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
c786_in      = input.color(color.rgb(255, 140, 0),  '78.6%  (extension)', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
catr_in      = input.color(color.white, '±1 ATR  (full range)', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')
cext_in      = input.color(color.new(color.orange, 0), 'Extensions', group='⑥ Levels: Colours & Visibility')


// ════════════════════════════⑦SESSION LEVELS ════════════════════════════
show_pdh_pdl_in = input.bool(true, 'Show Previous Period High / Low', group='⑦ Session Levels')
show_pmh_pml_in = input.bool(true, 'Show Premarket High / Low', group='⑦ Session Levels')
show_session_labels = input.bool(true, 'Show Their Labels', group='⑦ Session Levels')
pdh_color = input.color(color.rgb(0, 200, 220), 'Previous High', group='⑦ Session Levels')
pdl_color = input.color(color.rgb(220, 80, 200), 'Previous Low', group='⑦ Session Levels')
pmh_color = input.color(color.rgb(70, 130, 255), 'Premarket High', group='⑦ Session Levels')
pml_color = input.color(color.rgb(170, 90, 255), 'Premarket Low', group='⑦ Session Levels')
session_level_size = input.int(1, 'Line Thickness', minval=1, maxval=5, group='⑦ Session Levels')
premarket_session = input.session('0400-0930', 'Premarket Window',
     tooltip='US equity default 04:00-09:30 exchange time. Needs Extended Hours enabled on the chart or these stay blank.',
     group='⑦ Session Levels')
rth_session = input.session('0930-1600', 'Regular Session Window',
     tooltip='Defines regular hours for the signal gate, the premarket lock, and the trading-day boundary when signals are session-gated.',
     group='⑦ Session Levels')


// ════════════════════════════⑧10-MINUTE EMA8 ════════════════════════════
show_ema8_10m = input.bool(true, 'Show 10-minute EMA8',
     tooltip='Pulled from the 10-minute timeframe, so it draws the same line on a 1m, 3m or hourly chart. This is the EMA the entry study measured -- your chart\'s own 8 EMA is a different line.\nAbove a 10-minute chart it can only be approximated, and the Status row will say so.',
     group='⑧ 10-minute EMA8')
ema8_10m_mode = input.string('Confirmed (matches signals)', 'Source',
     options=['Confirmed (matches signals)', 'Live (tracks price, repaints)'],
     tooltip='Confirmed: the last COMPLETED 10-minute EMA8, exactly what the pullback signals test against. It draws as a staircase, stepping every 10 minutes -- that is the true shape, not a rendering fault.\nLive: the forming value. Smoother, but it moves within the bar.',
     group='⑧ 10-minute EMA8')
ema8_10m_color = input.color(color.rgb(120, 200, 255), 'Colour', group='⑧ 10-minute EMA8')
ema8_10m_width = input.int(2, 'Thickness', minval=1, maxval=5, group='⑧ 10-minute EMA8')
show_ema8_10m_label = input.bool(true, 'Show Price Label', group='⑧ 10-minute EMA8')


// ════════════════════════════⑨LABELS & SHADING ════════════════════════════
label_mode = input.string('Summary', 'Level Label Detail',
     options=['Detailed', 'Summary', 'Off'], group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
label_bg_color = input.color(color.new(color.rgb(15, 15, 25), 80), 'Label Background', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
label_text_color = input.color(color.white, 'Label Text', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
label_size_choice = input.string('Small', 'Level Label Size', options=['Tiny', 'Small', 'Normal'], group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
session_label_size_choice = input.string('Small', 'Price Tag Size', options=['Tiny', 'Small', 'Normal'], group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
show_fib_labels = input.bool(true, 'Show Price Tags on Levels', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
show_target_stop = input.bool(true, 'Show TARGET & STOP Tags', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
tp_label_size = input.string('Tiny', 'TARGET & STOP Size', options=['Tiny', 'Small', 'Normal', 'Large', 'Huge'], group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
label_right_offset = input.int(6, 'Label Offset (bars right of price)', minval=0, maxval=80, group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
show_trigger_box = input.bool(false, 'Shade the Trigger Box', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
show_golden_gate_box = input.bool(false, 'Shade the Golden Gate', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
trigger_box_color = input.color(color.new(color.yellow, 88), 'Trigger Box Shade', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
gg_bull_shade = input.color(color.new(color.green, 65), 'Gate Shade (bull)', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')
gg_bear_shade = input.color(color.new(color.red, 65), 'Gate Shade (bear)', group='⑨ Labels & Shading')


// ════════════════════════════⑩TREND & RUNNER ════════════════════════════
// FIX 14: these had drifted into the Labels group.
fast_ema  = input.int(8,  'Fast EMA (info table trend colour only)', minval=1, group='⑩ Trend & Runner')
pivot_ema = input.int(21, 'Pivot EMA', minval=1, group='⑩ Trend & Runner')
slow_ema  = input.int(34, 'Slow EMA', minval=1, group='⑩ Trend & Runner')
take_profit_choice = input.string('1.0 ATR (Classic)', 'Runner Target',
     options=['1.0 ATR (Classic)', '1.236 ATR', '1.618 ATR (Golden Ratio)', '2.0 ATR', '2.618 ATR', '3.0 ATR'],
     tooltip='A discretionary runner target, entirely separate from the researched Golden Gate target at 61.8%.',
     group='⑩ Trend & Runner')
tp_multiplier = take_profit_choice == '1.0 ATR (Classic)' ? 1.0 : take_profit_choice == '1.236 ATR' ? 1.236 : take_profit_choice == '1.618 ATR (Golden Ratio)' ? 1.618 : take_profit_choice == '2.0 ATR' ? 2.0 : take_profit_choice == '2.618 ATR' ? 2.618 : 3.0


// ════════════════════════════⑪ALERTS ════════════════════════════
alert_long  = input.bool(true, 'Enable Long Trigger Alert', group='⑪ Alerts')
alert_short = input.bool(true, 'Enable Short Trigger Alert',
     tooltip='Alert wording is deliberately mechanics-only. TradingView fixes alert text when the script compiles, so it cannot know which mode or symbol you are on -- quoting SPY percentages there would be wrong everywhere except SPY. The probabilities are in the dashboard, which does know the scope.',
     group='⑪ Alerts')


// ════════════════RESOLVED DISPLAY FLAGS + PALETTE ════════════════
eff_show_mid_ext = simple_mode ? false : show_mid_ext_in
eff_show_ext     = simple_mode ? false : show_ext_in
eff_show_pdh_pdl = simple_mode ? false : show_pdh_pdl_in
eff_show_pmh_pml = simple_mode ? false : show_pmh_pml_in

cb = palette == 'Colour-blind safe (Okabe-Ito)'
c_up      = cb ? color.rgb(0, 114, 178)   : trig_up_in
c_dn      = cb ? color.rgb(213, 94, 0)    : trig_dn_in
e_382     = cb ? color.rgb(86, 180, 233)  : c382_in
e_500     = cb ? color.rgb(140, 140, 140) : c500_in
e_618     = cb ? color.rgb(0, 158, 115)   : c618_in
e_786     = cb ? color.rgb(240, 228, 66)  : c786_in
e_atr1    = cb ? color.rgb(230, 230, 230) : catr_in
e_ext     = cb ? color.rgb(204, 121, 167) : cext_in
e_pdc     = cb ? color.rgb(255, 255, 255) : pdc_color_in
e_gg_bull = cb ? color.rgb(86, 180, 233)  : gg_bull_bar_in
e_gg_bear = cb ? color.rgb(230, 159, 0)   : gg_bear_bar_in

f_lbl_size(string choice) =>
    choice == 'Tiny' ? size.tiny : choice == 'Normal' ? size.normal : choice == 'Large' ? size.large : choice == 'Huge' ? size.huge : size.small

lbl_sz            = f_lbl_size(label_size_choice)
sess_lbl_sz       = f_lbl_size(session_label_size_choice)
tp_label_size_val = f_lbl_size(tp_label_size)


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// MILKMAN AUDITED STAT BLOCK — v2026-08-29   (UNCHANGED)
// Source: compiled SPY regular-hours sample, RTH 09:30-16:00 ET, 2000-2025.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
STAT_VERSION = 'Milkman stats v2026-08-29 (SPY RTH 2000-2025)'

S_days_open_in_box = 49.4
S_box_held_1h_bull = 75.3
S_box_held_1h_bear = 71.6

// 3-minute close trigger study (CALLS ONLY -- no put-side study exists)
S_call_conf_382    = 73.6
S_call_invalidated = 59.5
S_median_mins_382  = 18

S_trig_382_bull    = 78.5
S_trig_382_bear    = 79.0
S_l382_618_bull    = 62.7
S_l382_618_bear    = 65.5
S_l618_786_bull    = 68.9
S_l618_786_bear    = 74.7
S_l786_atr_bull    = 60.9
S_l786_atr_bear    = 66.9
S_day_atr_bull     = 13.8
S_day_atr_bear     = 16.1

S_gg_base_bull     = 62.5
S_gg_base_bear     = 65.4

// Bilbo -- CORRECTED 2026-04-26. Completed 1h bars only.
S_bilbo_hr         = 71.0
S_bilbo_hf         = 73.8
S_bilbo_lf         = 85.1
S_bilbo_lr         = 86.6

S_bilbo_786_bull   = 56.0
S_bilbo_atr_bull   = 34.7
S_bilbo_786_bear   = 75.9
S_bilbo_atr_bear   = 63.8
S_base_786_bull    = 43.2
S_base_786_bear    = 48.7

S_entry_imm_bull   = 61.3
S_entry_imm_bear   = 64.3
S_ev_imm_bull      = 8.9
S_ev_imm_bear      = 9.8
S_entry_ema8_bull  = 59.2
S_entry_ema8_bear  = 59.8
S_ev_ema8_bull     = 6.1
S_ev_ema8_bear     = 7.7
S_ev_mid50_bull    = -4.8
S_ev_mid50_bear    = -4.0
S_ev_trigpb_bull   = 12.4
S_ev_trigpb_bear   = 14.0

S_trig_holds_bull  = 84.0
S_trig_holds_bear  = 88.6

S_pdc_reclaim_trig = 73.0
S_pdc_reclaim_gg   = 49.0

S_open_gap_bull    = 86.0
S_open_gap_bear    = 88.0

ladder_bull(int h) =>
    h <= 9 ? 63.0 : h == 10 ? 57.0 : h == 11 ? 55.0 : h == 12 ? 48.0 : h == 13 ? 39.0 : h == 14 ? 41.0 : 16.0

ladder_bear(int h) =>
    h <= 9 ? 64.0 : h == 10 ? 60.0 : h == 11 ? 56.0 : h == 12 ? 56.0 : h == 13 ? 56.0 : h == 14 ? 48.0 : 30.0

pct(float v) => str.tostring(v, '#.#') + '%'
ev(float v)  => (v >= 0 ? '+' : '') + str.tostring(v, '#.#') + ' ATR%'

// FIX 3: labels read the live input rather than a hardcoded 23.6%.
trig_pct_txt = str.tostring(trigger_percentage * 100, '#.#') + '% ATR'


// ══════════════════════════════CORE LEVELS ══════════════════════════════
timeframe_func() =>
    trading_type == day_trading ? 'D' : trading_type == multiday_trading ? 'W' : trading_type == swing_trading ? 'M' : trading_type == position_trading ? '3M' : trading_type == longterm_trading ? '12M' : 'D'

price = close
fast_ema_value  = ta.ema(price, fast_ema)
pivot_ema_value = ta.ema(price, pivot_ema)
slow_ema_value  = ta.ema(price, slow_ema)
bullish = price >= fast_ema_value and fast_ema_value >= pivot_ema_value and pivot_ema_value >= slow_ema_value
bearish = price <= fast_ema_value and fast_ema_value <= pivot_ema_value and pivot_ema_value <= slow_ema_value

htf_ticker = ticker.new(syminfo.prefix, syminfo.ticker, session=session_mode == 'Regular (RTH)' ? session.regular : session.extended)
period_index = use_current_close ? 0 : 1

[htf_ref_close, htf_ref_atr, htf_cur_high, htf_cur_low, htf_prev_high, htf_prev_low] =
     request.security(htf_ticker, timeframe_func(),
          [close[period_index], ta.atr(atr_length)[period_index], high, low, high[1], low[1]],
          gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)

previous_close = htf_ref_close
atr            = htf_ref_atr
period_high    = htf_cur_high
period_low     = htf_cur_low
pdh            = htf_prev_high
pdl            = htf_prev_low

atr_safe = atr > 0 ? atr : na
range_1 = period_high - period_low
tr_percent_of_atr = atr > 0 ? range_1 / atr * 100 : 0.0

lower_trigger = previous_close - trigger_percentage * atr
upper_trigger = previous_close + trigger_percentage * atr

lower_0382 = previous_close - atr * 0.382
upper_0382 = previous_close + atr * 0.382
lower_0500 = previous_close - atr * 0.5
upper_0500 = previous_close + atr * 0.5
lower_0618 = previous_close - atr * 0.618
upper_0618 = previous_close + atr * 0.618
lower_0786 = previous_close - atr * 0.786
upper_0786 = previous_close + atr * 0.786
lower_1000 = previous_close - atr
upper_1000 = previous_close + atr
lower_1236 = lower_1000 - atr * 0.236
upper_1236 = upper_1000 + atr * 0.236
lower_1618 = lower_1000 - atr * 0.618
upper_1618 = upper_1000 + atr * 0.618
lower_2000 = lower_1000 - atr
upper_2000 = upper_1000 + atr
lower_2236 = lower_2000 - atr * 0.236
upper_2236 = upper_2000 + atr * 0.236
lower_2618 = lower_2000 - atr * 0.618
upper_2618 = upper_2000 + atr * 0.618


// ══════════════════════════════SESSION / TIME ══════════════════════════════
in_premarket = not na(time(timeframe.period, premarket_session))
in_rth       = not na(time(timeframe.period, rth_session))

day_key = year * 10000 + month * 100 + dayofmonth
new_rth = in_rth and (not in_rth[1] or day_key != day_key[1])
new_pm  = in_premarket and not in_premarket[1]

hour_et      = hour(time, 'America/New_York')
minute_et    = minute(time, 'America/New_York')
time_decimal = hour_et + minute_et / 60.0

var int sess_start_bar = 0
if new_rth
    sess_start_bar := bar_index

var float pm_high_live = na
var float pm_low_live  = na
var float pm_high_lock = na
var float pm_low_lock  = na

if new_pm
    pm_high_live := high
    pm_low_live  := low
else if in_premarket
    pm_high_live := math.max(nz(pm_high_live, high), high)
    pm_low_live  := math.min(nz(pm_low_live, low), low)

if new_rth
    pm_high_lock := pm_high_live
    pm_low_lock  := pm_low_live

pm_high = in_premarket ? pm_high_live : pm_high_lock
pm_low  = in_premarket ? pm_low_live  : pm_low_lock


// ══════════════════════════════SIGNAL GATE ══════════════════════════════
is_3m = timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier == 3
tf_ok_for_signals = signal_tf_mode == 'Strict 3m (Milkman)' ? is_3m : true
session_ok_for_signals = signal_session == 'Every bar (24h markets)' ? true : signal_session == 'Premarket + regular hours' ? (in_rth or in_premarket) : in_rth
signal_close = tf_ok_for_signals and session_ok_for_signals and barstate.isconfirmed

// FIX 4: the trading day follows the signal session. A 24-hour market rolls on the
// exchange date -- which is also when the levels themselves roll -- rather than at
// an arbitrary 09:30 ET that would clear a live trade mid-move.
new_session = signal_session == 'Every bar (24h markets)' ? day_key != day_key[1] : new_rth

// FIX 5: "first hour" is 60 minutes from whenever that session began. On SPY under
// the Milkman mode this is still exactly 09:30-10:30 ET.
var int session_start_ms = na
if new_session
    session_start_ms := time
first_hour = not na(session_start_ms) and time - session_start_ms <= 3600000

// FIX 7: the 10m and 1h series are lower-timeframe requests. Above their own
// timeframe request.security returns an intrabar value, not a usable series, so
// anything derived from them has to be suppressed rather than silently wrong.
chart_mins = timeframe.isseconds ? timeframe.multiplier / 60.0 :
     timeframe.isminutes ? timeframe.multiplier :
     timeframe.isdaily ? 1440.0 :
     timeframe.isweekly ? 10080.0 :
     timeframe.ismonthly ? 43200.0 : 0.0

htf_10m_ok = chart_mins > 0 and chart_mins <= 10
htf_1h_ok  = chart_mins > 0 and chart_mins <= 60


// ══════════════════════════════STAT SCOPE ══════════════════════════════
// FIX 9: exact match. SPYG, SPYD and SPYV are different instruments.
sym_ok  = syminfo.ticker == 'SPY' or syminfo.ticker == 'SPX'
mode_ok = trading_type == day_trading
sess_ok = session_mode == 'Regular (RTH)'
in_scope = sym_ok and is_3m and mode_ok and sess_ok

stats_valid = p_univ ? false : p_milk ? in_scope : (not enforce_scope or in_scope)

st(string s) => stats_valid ? s : ''

// FIX 11: one compact line on the chart. The reasoning lives in the Mode tooltip
// and the legend, not in a 250-character table cell.
mode_short = p_milk ? 'MILKMAN' : p_univ ? 'UNIVERSAL' : 'CUSTOM'
mode_line =
     p_milk ? 'MILKMAN  ·  SPY/SPX · 3m · RTH\n1 entry per direction per day · no buffer\nstats ' + (stats_valid ? 'ON' : 'HIDDEN -- chart is out of scope') :
     p_univ ? 'UNIVERSAL  ·  any market & timeframe\n24h signals · 1% ATR buffer · unlimited re-entries\nstats OFF by design' :
     'CUSTOM  ·  ' + (tf_ok_for_signals ? 'any timeframe' : '3m only') + ' · ' + signal_session + '\n' + (max_entries == 0 ? 'unlimited' : str.tostring(max_entries)) + ' entries · ' + str.tostring(buffer_pct, '#.#') + '% buffer\nstats ' + (stats_valid ? 'ON' : 'HIDDEN')

scope_reason = (sym_ok ? '' : ' symbol') + (is_3m ? '' : ' 3m') + (mode_ok ? '' : ' Day-period') + (sess_ok ? '' : ' RTH-session')
scope_tag = p_univ ? '' : stats_valid ? '' : '  |  stats hidden -- off:' + scope_reason


// ══════════════════BILBO -- COMPLETED 1h BARS ONLY ══════════════════
po_1h = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '60',
     ta.ema(((close - ta.ema(close, 21)) / (3.0 * ta.atr(14))) * 100, 3)[1],
     gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
po_1h_prev = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '60',
     ta.ema(((close - ta.ema(close, 21)) / (3.0 * ta.atr(14))) * 100, 3)[2],
     gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)

c10_1 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '10', close[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
c10_2 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '10', close[2], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
new_10m = ta.change(time('10')) != 0

ema8_10m = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '10', ta.ema(close, 8)[1], gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on)
ema8_10m_live = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, '10', ta.ema(close, 8), gaps=barmerge.gaps_off, lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_off)
ema8_10m_plot = ema8_10m_mode == 'Live (tracks price, repaints)' ? ema8_10m_live : ema8_10m

po_extended_up   = po_1h >  100
po_distribution  = po_1h >   61.8 and po_1h <=  100
po_neutral_up    = po_1h >   23.6 and po_1h <=  61.8
po_neutral_zone  = po_1h >= -23.6 and po_1h <=  23.6
po_neutral_down  = po_1h >= -61.8 and po_1h <  -23.6
po_accumulation  = po_1h >= -100  and po_1h <  -61.8
po_extended_down = po_1h <  -100

po_1h_rising  = po_1h > po_1h_prev
po_1h_falling = po_1h < po_1h_prev

bull_bilbo_active = po_distribution
bear_bilbo_active = po_accumulation

// The old mid-zone "weak buckets" are deleted -- artifacts of the pre-2026-04-26
// look-ahead bug. Mid-zone PO slope carries no signal.
po_zone_name = po_extended_up ? 'EXTENDED UP' : po_distribution ? 'DISTRIBUTION' : po_neutral_up ? 'NEUTRAL UP' :
     po_neutral_zone ? 'NEUTRAL' : po_neutral_down ? 'NEUTRAL DOWN' : po_accumulation ? 'ACCUMULATION' :
     po_extended_down ? 'EXTENDED DOWN' : 'UNKNOWN'

bilbo_color =
     bull_bilbo_active ? color.new(color.rgb(255, 215, 0), 15) :
     bear_bilbo_active ? color.new(color.orange, 15) :
     po_neutral_up     ? color.new(color.green, 55) :
     po_neutral_down   ? color.new(color.red, 55) :
     color.new(color.gray, 50)


// ══════════════════════════════LOCATION ══════════════════════════════
in_bull_trigger_box = close > previous_close and close < upper_trigger
in_bear_trigger_box = close < previous_close and close > lower_trigger
in_trigger_box      = in_bull_trigger_box or in_bear_trigger_box


// ══════════════════TRADE STATE + SIGNAL HYGIENE ══════════════════
var bool long_active   = false
var bool short_active  = false
var int  trigger_hour  = na
var int  bars_since_trigger = 0
var bool bull_reached_382 = false
var bool bear_reached_382 = false
var int  long_entry_count = 0
var int  short_entry_count = 0
var int  bars_since_long_exit  = 9999
var int  bars_since_short_exit = 9999

trig_buf   = buffer_pct / 100.0 * atr
long_line  = upper_trigger + trig_buf
short_line = lower_trigger - trig_buf
has_buffer = buffer_pct > 0

// FIX 2: the cross reference follows the SIGNAL SESSION. Keying it to regular hours
// froze it overnight on a 24-hour market, so for most of the day the "previous
// close" it compared against was stale by many hours.
var float sess_prev_close = na
cross_ref = gap_safe_cross and not na(sess_prev_close) ? sess_prev_close : close[1]

raw_long_trigger  = signal_close and close > long_line  and cross_ref <= long_line
raw_short_trigger = signal_close and close < short_line and cross_ref >= short_line

long_armed  = not long_active  and (max_entries == 0 or long_entry_count  < max_entries) and bars_since_long_exit  >= cooldown_bars
short_armed = not short_active and (max_entries == 0 or short_entry_count < max_entries) and bars_since_short_exit >= cooldown_bars

entry_long_trigger  = raw_long_trigger  and long_armed
entry_short_trigger = raw_short_trigger and short_armed

suppressed_long  = raw_long_trigger  and not long_armed
suppressed_short = raw_short_trigger and not short_armed

// The exit always uses the trigger itself, never the buffered entry line. A buffer
// filters which signals you take; it should not move your stop.
exit_long  = signal_close and long_active  and close < upper_trigger
exit_short = signal_close and short_active and close > lower_trigger

if new_session
    long_active           := false
    short_active          := false
    trigger_hour          := na
    bars_since_trigger    := 0
    bull_reached_382      := false
    bear_reached_382      := false
    long_entry_count      := 0
    short_entry_count     := 0
    bars_since_long_exit  := 9999
    bars_since_short_exit := 9999

if signal_close
    bars_since_long_exit  := bars_since_long_exit  + 1
    bars_since_short_exit := bars_since_short_exit + 1

if entry_long_trigger
    long_active        := true
    short_active       := false
    trigger_hour       := hour_et
    bars_since_trigger := 0
    bull_reached_382   := false
    long_entry_count   := long_entry_count + 1

if entry_short_trigger
    short_active       := true
    long_active        := false
    trigger_hour       := hour_et
    bars_since_trigger := 0
    bear_reached_382   := false
    short_entry_count  := short_entry_count + 1

if exit_long
    long_active          := false
    bars_since_long_exit := 0
if exit_short
    short_active          := false
    bars_since_short_exit := 0

if signal_close and (long_active or short_active) and not (entry_long_trigger or entry_short_trigger)
    bars_since_trigger := bars_since_trigger + 1

// Updated last, so cross_ref always reads the PREVIOUS in-session close.
if session_ok_for_signals and barstate.isconfirmed
    sess_prev_close := close

if long_active and close >= upper_0382
    bull_reached_382 := true
if short_active and close <= lower_0382
    bear_reached_382 := true

entry_long_gg  = signal_close and long_active  and close >= upper_0382 and close[1] < upper_0382
entry_short_gg = signal_close and short_active and close <= lower_0382 and close[1] > lower_0382

// FIX 15: the study measured the EMA8 pullback as an entry INSIDE the Golden Gate,
// so the Gate must have opened first. FIX 7: suppressed above a 10m chart.
raw_long_ema8  = signal_close and htf_10m_ok and long_active  and bull_reached_382 and close <= upper_0618 and low  <= ema8_10m and close > ema8_10m
raw_short_ema8 = signal_close and htf_10m_ok and short_active and bear_reached_382 and close >= lower_0618 and high >= ema8_10m and close < ema8_10m
entry_long_ema8  = raw_long_ema8  and (not pb_debounce or not raw_long_ema8[1])
entry_short_ema8 = raw_short_ema8 and (not pb_debounce or not raw_short_ema8[1])

raw_long_trigpb  = signal_close and long_active  and bull_reached_382 and low  <= upper_trigger and close > upper_trigger
raw_short_trigpb = signal_close and short_active and bear_reached_382 and high >= lower_trigger and close < lower_trigger
entry_long_trigpb  = raw_long_trigpb  and (not pb_debounce or not raw_long_trigpb[1])
entry_short_trigpb = raw_short_trigpb and (not pb_debounce or not raw_short_trigpb[1])

pdc_reclaim_bull = htf_10m_ok and new_10m and first_hour and c10_1 > previous_close and c10_2 <= previous_close and c10_2 >= lower_trigger
pdc_reclaim_bear = htf_10m_ok and new_10m and first_hour and c10_1 < previous_close and c10_2 >= previous_close and c10_2 <= upper_trigger

bar_counter_color = bars_since_trigger <= 6 ? color.new(color.green, 40) :
     bars_since_trigger <= 12 ? color.new(color.orange, 40) : color.new(color.gray, 40)

vol_avg = ta.sma(volume, 20)
rel_vol = vol_avg > 0 ? volume / vol_avg : 1.0
rel_vol_pct = math.round(rel_vol * 100)
vol_note = 'RelVol ' + str.tostring(rel_vol_pct) + '% (' + (rel_vol >= 1.5 ? 'high' : rel_vol >= 0.8 ? 'normal' : 'low') + ') -- discretionary'


// ══════════════════════════════INFO TABLE ══════════════════════════════
tr_vs_atr_color = tr_percent_of_atr <= 70 ? color.green : tr_percent_of_atr >= 90 ? color.red : color.orange
trading_mode = trading_type == day_trading ? 'Day' : trading_type == multiday_trading ? 'Multiday' : trading_type == swing_trading ? 'Swing' : trading_type == position_trading ? 'Position' : 'Long-term'
long_label  = use_options_labels ? 'Calls' : 'Long'
short_label = use_options_labels ? 'Puts' : 'Short'
trend_color = bullish ? color.green : bearish ? color.red : color.orange
table_size_val = table_size == 'Small' ? size.small : table_size == 'Large' ? size.large : size.normal
session_tag = session_mode == 'Regular (RTH)' ? 'RTH' : 'EXT'
table_pos = table_position == 'Top Right' ? position.top_right : table_position == 'Bottom Left' ? position.bottom_left : position.bottom_right

var tbl = table.new(table_pos, 1, 6, border_width=1, frame_color=trend_color)
if barstate.islast and show_info
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 0, 'Trinity ATR Levels  [' + session_tag + ']', bgcolor=trend_color, text_size=table_size_val)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 1, trading_mode + ' Range ($' + str.tostring(range_1, '#.##') + ') is ' + str.tostring(tr_percent_of_atr, '#.#') + '% of ATR', bgcolor=tr_vs_atr_color, text_size=table_size_val)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 2, 'PDC $' + str.tostring(previous_close, '#.##') + '  ATR $' + str.tostring(atr, '#.##'), bgcolor=color.new(color.gray, 20), text_size=table_size_val)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 3, long_label  + ' > $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##'), bgcolor=c_up, text_size=table_size_val)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 4, short_label + ' < $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##'), bgcolor=c_dn, text_size=table_size_val)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 5, 'PDH $' + str.tostring(pdh, '#.##') + '  PDL $' + str.tostring(pdl, '#.##') + '  PMH $' + str.tostring(pm_high, '#.##') + '  PML $' + str.tostring(pm_low, '#.##'), bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(180, 190, 210), 0), text_color=color.black, text_size=table_size_val)


// ══════════════════════════════TIMING LADDER ══════════════════════════════
latched_bull = ladder_bull(nz(trigger_hour, 9))
latched_bear = ladder_bear(nz(trigger_hour, 9))
latched_pct  = long_active ? latched_bull : short_active ? latched_bear : na

time_quality =
     long_active or short_active ?
          'TRIGGERED ' + str.tostring(nz(trigger_hour, 9)) + ':00 ET' + st('  |  Gate completion for this trigger hour: ' + pct(latched_pct) + '  (' + (long_active ? 'bull' : 'bear') + ' ladder)') :
     time_decimal < 9.5  ? 'PRE-MARKET  |  Levels set. Wait for the open.' :
     time_decimal < 10.0 ? 'OPEN' + st('  |  Gap straight through 38.2%: bull ' + pct(S_open_gap_bull) + ' / bear ' + pct(S_open_gap_bear)) + '  |  Best window of the day.' :
     'NO TRIGGER YET  |  ' + str.tostring(hour_et) + ':00 ET' + st('  |  If one latches now: bull ' + pct(ladder_bull(hour_et)) + ' / bear ' + pct(ladder_bear(hour_et)))

timing_color = not stats_valid ? color.new(color.rgb(70, 70, 90), 20) :
     na(latched_pct) ? color.new(color.gray, 40) :
     latched_pct >= 60 ? color.new(color.green, 20) :
     latched_pct >= 45 ? color.new(color.orange, 30) :
     color.new(color.red, 25)


// ══════════════════════════════DASHBOARD STRINGS ══════════════════════════════
mk_tbl_pos  = milkman_table_position == 'Top Left' ? position.top_left : milkman_table_position == 'Top Right' ? position.top_right : milkman_table_position == 'Bottom Left' ? position.bottom_left : position.bottom_right
mk_tbl_size = milkman_table_size == 'Small' ? size.small : milkman_table_size == 'Large' ? size.large : size.normal

price_zone =
     close >= upper_1000 ? 'Above +1 ATR -- full range hit.' + st(' Rare (' + pct(S_day_atr_bull) + ' of days).') :
     close >= upper_0786 ? 'Between 78.6% and +1 ATR -- post-Gate extension.' :
     close >= upper_0618 ? 'At or above 61.8% -- Golden Gate complete.' :
     close >= upper_0500 ? 'Between 50% and 61.8% -- inside the Gate, past midpoint.' :
     close >= upper_0382 ? 'Between 38.2% and 50% -- the Gate just opened.' :
     close >= upper_trigger  ? 'Between trigger and 38.2% -- en route to the Gate.' :
     close >= previous_close ? 'Between PDC and call trigger -- bull trigger box.' :
     close >= lower_trigger  ? 'Between PDC and put trigger -- bear trigger box.' :
     close >= lower_0382 ? 'Between trigger and 38.2% -- en route to the bear Gate.' :
     close >= lower_0500 ? 'Between 38.2% and 50% -- bear Gate just opened.' :
     close >= lower_0618 ? 'Between 50% and 61.8% -- inside the bear Gate.' :
     close >= lower_0786 ? 'At or below 61.8% -- bear Golden Gate complete.' :
     close >= lower_1000 ? 'Between 78.6% and -1 ATR -- bear post-Gate extension.' :
     'Below -1 ATR -- full bear range hit.' + st(' Rare (' + pct(S_day_atr_bear) + ' of days).')

dash_bull = cb ? color.new(color.rgb(0, 80, 125), 0) : color.new(color.rgb(20, 90, 30), 0)
dash_bear = cb ? color.new(color.rgb(150, 66, 0), 0) : color.new(color.rgb(110, 20, 20), 0)
dash_wait = color.new(color.rgb(150, 120, 10), 5)
price_zone_color = long_active ? dash_bull : short_active ? dash_bear : dash_wait

tf_warning = tf_ok_for_signals ? '' : '\n⚠Signals gated OFF -- not a 3m chart.'

// FIX 8: when a buffer is set, both prices are shown wherever they differ.
entry_price_txt(bool up) => has_buffer ?
     '$' + str.tostring(up ? long_line : short_line, '#.##') + ' (trigger $' + str.tostring(up ? upper_trigger : lower_trigger, '#.##') + ' + ' + str.tostring(buffer_pct, '#.#') + '% ATR buffer)' :
     '$' + str.tostring(up ? upper_trigger : lower_trigger, '#.##')

watch_note =
     long_active  and close < upper_0382 ? 'HOLD above $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + ' on a confirmed close.\nClose back below = EXIT.' + st(' Same-day 38.2% falls to ' + pct(S_call_invalidated) + '.') + tf_warning :
     short_active and close > lower_0382 ? 'HOLD below $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + ' on a confirmed close.\nClose back above = EXIT.' + st(' (Invalidation % is calls-only research.)') + tf_warning :
     long_active  and close < upper_0618 ? 'Confirmed close back BELOW the trigger = EXIT.\nWatch the trigger and 10m EMA8 for re-entry.' :
     short_active and close > lower_0618 ? 'Confirmed close back ABOVE the trigger = EXIT.\nWatch the trigger and 10m EMA8 for re-entry.' :
     close >= upper_0618 ? 'Trail to 38.2%. Gate complete.' + st('\nTo 78.6%: ' + pct(S_l618_786_bull) + ' (' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bull) + ' with Bilbo).') :
     close <= lower_0618 ? 'Trail to 38.2%. Bear Gate done.' + st('\nTo 78.6%: ' + pct(S_l618_786_bear) + ' (' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bear) + ' with Bilbo).') :
     in_bull_trigger_box ? 'Confirmed close ABOVE ' + entry_price_txt(true) + ' = enter.\nPDC reclaim in the first hour = flip bear' + st(' (' + pct(S_pdc_reclaim_trig) + ' reach the opposite trigger)') + '.' + tf_warning :
     in_bear_trigger_box ? 'Confirmed close BELOW ' + entry_price_txt(false) + ' = enter.\nPDC reclaim in the first hour = flip bull' + st(' (' + pct(S_pdc_reclaim_trig) + ' reach the opposite trigger)') + '.' + tf_warning :
     'No active setup. Wait for the trigger box.' + st('\n' + pct(S_days_open_in_box) + ' of days open there.')

entry_note =
     entry_long_trigger  ? 'ENTER LONG  ' + entry_price_txt(true) + st('\n' + pct(S_call_conf_382) + ' reach 38.2% same day. Close back below -> ' + pct(S_call_invalidated) + ' = exit.') :
     entry_short_trigger ? 'ENTER SHORT  ' + entry_price_txt(false) + st('\nTrigger to 38.2%: ' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + '. No put-side 3m study exists.') :
     entry_long_trigpb   ? 'T-PB LONG (pullback to trigger)' + st('  -- BEST EV ' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bull)) + '\nTarget 61.8% $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') :
     entry_short_trigpb  ? 'T-PB SHORT (pullback to trigger)' + st('  -- BEST EV ' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bear)) + '\nTarget 61.8% $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') :
     entry_long_gg       ? 'GATE ENTRY LONG  $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + st('\nImmediate: ' + pct(S_entry_imm_bull) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_imm_bull) + '.') + ' Target 61.8%.' :
     entry_short_gg      ? 'GATE ENTRY SHORT  $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + st('\nImmediate: ' + pct(S_entry_imm_bear) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_imm_bear) + '.') + ' Target 61.8%.' :
     entry_long_ema8     ? 'EMA8 PULLBACK LONG (10-minute EMA8)' + st('\n' + pct(S_entry_ema8_bull) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_ema8_bull) + ' -- ranks below the trigger pullback.') :
     entry_short_ema8    ? 'EMA8 PULLBACK SHORT (10-minute EMA8)' + st('\n' + pct(S_entry_ema8_bear) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_ema8_bear) + ' -- ranks below the trigger pullback.') :
     long_active  and close < upper_0382 ? 'In trade. Riding to 38.2%.\nNext entries: Gate open, T-PB' + (htf_10m_ok ? ', EMA8.' : '. (EMA8 needs a 10m or faster chart.)') :
     short_active and close > lower_0382 ? 'In trade. Riding to 38.2%.\nNext entries: Gate open, T-PB' + (htf_10m_ok ? ', EMA8.' : '. (EMA8 needs a 10m or faster chart.)') :
     in_bull_trigger_box ? 'No entry yet.\nWait for a confirmed close above ' + entry_price_txt(true) :
     in_bear_trigger_box ? 'No entry yet.\nWait for a confirmed close below ' + entry_price_txt(false) :
     'No setup active.'

entry_color =
     entry_long_trigger or entry_long_gg or entry_long_ema8 or entry_long_trigpb ? color.new(color.green, 5) :
     entry_short_trigger or entry_short_gg or entry_short_ema8 or entry_short_trigpb ? color.new(color.red, 5) :
     suppressed_long or suppressed_short ? color.new(color.rgb(120, 90, 20), 10) :
     (in_trigger_box or long_active or short_active) ? color.new(color.orange, 30) :
     color.new(color.gray, 60)

target_note =
     long_active and close < upper_0382 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + ' (38.2%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_trig_382_bull)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)' + st('  ' + (bull_bilbo_active ? pct(po_1h_rising ? S_bilbo_hr : S_bilbo_hf) + ' BILBO' : pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' baseline')) :
     long_active and close >= upper_0382 and close < upper_0618 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_l382_618_bull)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(upper_0786, '#.##') + ' (78.6%)' + st('  ' + (bull_bilbo_active ? pct(S_bilbo_786_bull) + ' Bilbo' : pct(S_base_786_bull) + ' base')) :
     close >= upper_0618 and close < upper_0786 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(upper_0786, '#.##') + ' (78.6%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_l618_786_bull)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(upper_1000, '#.##') + ' (+1 ATR)' + st('  ' + (bull_bilbo_active ? pct(S_bilbo_atr_bull) + ' Bilbo' : pct(S_l786_atr_bull) + ' from 78.6')) :
     short_active and close > lower_0382 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + ' (38.2%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_trig_382_bear)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)' + st('  ' + (bear_bilbo_active ? pct(po_1h_falling ? S_bilbo_lf : S_bilbo_lr) + ' BILBO' : pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ' baseline')) :
     short_active and close <= lower_0382 and close > lower_0618 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_l382_618_bear)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(lower_0786, '#.##') + ' (78.6%)' + st('  ' + (bear_bilbo_active ? pct(S_bilbo_786_bear) + ' Bilbo' : pct(S_base_786_bear) + ' base')) :
     close <= lower_0618 and close > lower_0786 ?
          'T1: $' + str.tostring(lower_0786, '#.##') + ' (78.6%)' + st('  ' + pct(S_l618_786_bear)) + '\nT2: $' + str.tostring(lower_1000, '#.##') + ' (-1 ATR)' + st('  ' + (bear_bilbo_active ? pct(S_bilbo_atr_bear) + ' Bilbo' : pct(S_l786_atr_bear) + ' from 78.6')) :
     in_bull_trigger_box ?
          'If triggered: T1 $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_trig_382_bull) + ')') + '\nGate T2 $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + st('  ' + (bull_bilbo_active ? '(BILBO active)' : '(' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' baseline)')) :
     in_bear_trigger_box ?
          'If triggered: T1 $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + ')') + '\nGate T2 $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + st('  ' + (bear_bilbo_active ? '(BILBO active)' : '(' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ' baseline)')) :
     'No active target'

buffer_stop_note = has_buffer ? '\nEntry was ' + str.tostring(buffer_pct, '#.#') + '% ATR beyond this; the stop uses the trigger itself.' : ''

stop_note =
     long_active  and close >= upper_0382 ? 'Confirmed close below $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + st('\nTrigger holding -> ' + pct(S_trig_holds_bull) + ' Gate completion (10m closes)') + buffer_stop_note :
     long_active                          ? 'Confirmed close below $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + '\nEXIT.' + st(' Reaching 38.2% drops to ' + pct(S_call_invalidated) + '.') + buffer_stop_note :
     short_active and close <= lower_0382 ? 'Confirmed close above $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + st('\nTrigger holding -> ' + pct(S_trig_holds_bear) + ' Gate completion (10m closes)') + buffer_stop_note :
     short_active                         ? 'Confirmed close above $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + '\nEXIT immediately on any close back above.' + buffer_stop_note :
     close >= upper_0618 and close < upper_0786 ? 'Trail to $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + ' (38.2%)\nGate gain locked in' :
     close <= lower_0618 and close > lower_0786 ? 'Trail to $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + ' (38.2%)\nGate gain locked in' :
     close >= upper_0786 ? 'Trail to $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)\nProtect the extension' :
     close <= lower_0786 ? 'Trail to $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + ' (61.8%)\nProtect the extension' :
     'No stop active yet'

stall_note =
     long_active  and close < upper_0382 ? st('Median winner reaches 38.2% in ' + str.tostring(S_median_mins_382) + ' min -- half take longer.\n') + 'There is no time stop in the research. [discretionary]' :
     short_active and close > lower_0382 ? st('Median winner reaches 38.2% in ' + str.tostring(S_median_mins_382) + ' min -- half take longer.\n') + 'There is no time stop in the research. [discretionary]' :
     close >= upper_0382 and close < upper_0500 ? 'Consolidation at 38.2% is normal.\nWatch the trigger, not the stall. [discretionary]' :
     close <= lower_0382 and close > lower_0500 ? 'Consolidation at 38.2% is normal.\nWatch the trigger, not the stall. [discretionary]' :
     close >= upper_0500 and close < upper_0618 ? 'At 50% -- do NOT enter fresh.' + st(' EV ' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bull) + '.') + '\nHold to 61.8%.' :
     close <= lower_0500 and close > lower_0618 ? 'At 50% -- do NOT enter fresh.' + st(' EV ' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bear) + '.') + '\nHold to 61.8%.' :
     close >= upper_0618 ? 'Scale out. Check the 1h PO.' + st('\nBilbo? ' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bull) + ' reach 78.6%. No Bilbo: ' + pct(S_base_786_bull) + '.') :
     close <= lower_0618 ? 'Scale out. Check the 1h PO.' + st('\nBilbo? ' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bear) + ' reach 78.6%. No Bilbo: ' + pct(S_base_786_bear) + '.') :
     in_trigger_box ? 'Box held 1h (10m closes) -> Gate opens.' + st('\nBull ' + pct(S_box_held_1h_bull) + ' / bear ' + pct(S_box_held_1h_bear) + '. First-hour PDC reclaim reaches the opposite 38.2% ' + pct(S_pdc_reclaim_gg) + ' of the time.') :
     'No stall scenario active.'

bilbo_tf_note = htf_1h_ok ? '' : '\n⚠above 1h -- the PO is approximated.'

bilbo_active_text =
     bull_bilbo_active ? (po_1h_rising ?
          'BULL BILBO  High+Rising' + st('  ' + pct(S_bilbo_hr) + '  (n=193)  |  Full size. Runners past 61.8% viable.') + bilbo_tf_note :
          'BULL BILBO  High+Falling' + st('  ' + pct(S_bilbo_hf) + '  (n=168)  |  Full size. Watch if PO leaves the zone.') + bilbo_tf_note) :
     bear_bilbo_active ? (po_1h_falling ?
          'BEAR BILBO  Low+Falling' + st('  ' + pct(S_bilbo_lf) + '  (n=141)  |  Strongest state. ' + pct(S_bilbo_atr_bear) + ' reach full ATR.') + bilbo_tf_note :
          'BEAR BILBO  Low+Rising' + st('  ' + pct(S_bilbo_lr) + '  (n=149)  |  Full size. Watch if PO leaves the zone.') + bilbo_tf_note) :
     'No Bilbo  ·  ' + po_zone_name + '\nMid-zone PO slope = NO signal.' + st('\nBaselines: bull ' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' / bear ' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + '.') + bilbo_tf_note

lvl_dist(float lvl) =>
    diff = lvl - close
    (diff >= 0 ? '+' : '') + str.tostring(diff, '#.##') + (na(atr_safe) ? '' : ' (' + str.tostring(math.abs(diff) / atr_safe * 100, '#.#') + '% ATR)')

gg_progress = long_active and close > upper_0382 and upper_0618 > upper_0382 ? (close - upper_0382) / (upper_0618 - upper_0382) * 100 :
     short_active and close < lower_0382 and lower_0382 > lower_0618 ? (lower_0382 - close) / (lower_0382 - lower_0618) * 100 : na

bias_up = long_active or in_bull_trigger_box or (not short_active and close >= previous_close)

// Stacked, not strung out: a single line of three distances was the widest cell in
// the panel and dragged the whole table across the chart.
dist_note = (bias_up ?
     'Trigger  ' + lvl_dist(upper_trigger) + '\n38.2%    ' + lvl_dist(upper_0382) + '\n61.8%    ' + lvl_dist(upper_0618) :
     'Trigger  ' + lvl_dist(lower_trigger) + '\n38.2%    ' + lvl_dist(lower_0382) + '\n61.8%    ' + lvl_dist(lower_0618)) +
     (na(gg_progress) ? '' : '\nThrough the Gate: ' + str.tostring(math.min(100, math.max(0, gg_progress)), '#') + '%')

budget_used_long  = max_entries > 0 and long_entry_count  >= max_entries
budget_used_short = max_entries > 0 and short_entry_count >= max_entries

// FIX 7: degradation is reported, not hidden.
tf_degrade_note = htf_10m_ok ? '' : '\n⚠' + timeframe.period + ' chart: the 10m EMA8 pullback and\nPDC reclaim are off (10m cannot be read from a slower chart).'

diagnostic =
     not tf_ok_for_signals ? 'SIGNALS OFF -- chart is ' + timeframe.period + '\nThis mode only fires on 3m. Change chart or mode.' :
     not session_ok_for_signals ? 'SIGNALS OFF -- outside the signal session\n(' + rth_session + ' exchange time). Levels stay live.' :
     long_active  ? 'LONG live. Exit: a confirmed close below $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + '.' + tf_degrade_note :
     short_active ? 'SHORT live. Exit: a confirmed close above $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + '.' + tf_degrade_note :
     suppressed_long  ? 'Cross seen, entry BLOCKED -- ' + (budget_used_long  ? 'long budget used (' + str.tostring(long_entry_count)  + '/' + str.tostring(max_entries) + ') for this session.' : 'cooldown, ' + str.tostring(math.max(0, cooldown_bars - bars_since_long_exit))  + ' more bar(s).') :
     suppressed_short ? 'Cross seen, entry BLOCKED -- ' + (budget_used_short ? 'short budget used (' + str.tostring(short_entry_count) + '/' + str.tostring(max_entries) + ') for this session.' : 'cooldown, ' + str.tostring(math.max(0, cooldown_bars - bars_since_short_exit)) + ' more bar(s).') :
     in_bull_trigger_box ? 'WAITING -- need a confirmed close above\n$' + str.tostring(long_line, '#.##') + ', currently ' + lvl_dist(long_line) + ' away.' + tf_degrade_note :
     in_bear_trigger_box ? 'WAITING -- need a confirmed close below\n$' + str.tostring(short_line, '#.##') + ', currently ' + lvl_dist(short_line) + ' away.' + tf_degrade_note :
     close > upper_trigger and budget_used_long  ? 'Above the call trigger, but the long budget\nis used for this session. Pullback entries only.' :
     close < lower_trigger and budget_used_short ? 'Below the put trigger, but the short budget\nis used for this session. Pullback entries only.' :
     close > upper_trigger ? 'Above the call trigger with no open trade --\nthe cross happened outside the signal session.' :
     close < lower_trigger ? 'Below the put trigger with no open trade --\nthe cross happened outside the signal session.' :
     'WAITING -- price is at PDC, outside both\ntrigger boxes. No setup forming.' + tf_degrade_note

diagnostic_color =
     not tf_ok_for_signals or not session_ok_for_signals ? color.new(color.rgb(120, 60, 0), 10) :
     not htf_10m_ok ? color.new(color.rgb(100, 70, 10), 10) :
     long_active or short_active ? color.new(color.rgb(20, 70, 40), 10) :
     suppressed_long or suppressed_short ? color.new(color.rgb(120, 90, 20), 10) :
     color.new(color.rgb(35, 40, 60), 10)

context_note = 'Bar ' + str.tostring(bars_since_trigger) + ' since trigger\nEntries: long ' + str.tostring(long_entry_count) + (max_entries > 0 ? '/' + str.tostring(max_entries) : '') + ', short ' + str.tostring(short_entry_count) + (max_entries > 0 ? '/' + str.tostring(max_entries) : '') + '\n' + vol_note


// ══════════════════════════════DASHBOARD ══════════════════════════════
// Two columns in both layouts. The Bilbo meter used to occupy ten of its own
// columns, which is what forced the panel so wide; it is now a text gauge in a
// single cell.

// Where Bilbo is explained: hovering the BILBO row gives the full definition, in
// the one place someone is actually looking when they wonder what it means.
BILBO_TIP = 'BILBO -- the 1-hour Phase Oscillator filter.\n\n' +
     'The Phase Oscillator measures how far price has stretched from its 21-period EMA, scaled by ATR, so it reads roughly -150 to +150 on any instrument.\n\n' +
     'Above +61.8 is the DISTRIBUTION zone. Below -61.8 is ACCUMULATION. When a Golden Gate setup triggers while the last COMPLETED 1-hour bar sits in one of those outer zones, the Gate historically completed more often than baseline. That condition is what "Bilbo" names -- it is a filter on the setup you already have, not a signal of its own.\n\n' +
     'The gauge runs bear on the left to bull on the right. The arrow marks the current reading and points up or down according to whether the oscillator rose or fell against the previous completed hour.\n\n' +
     'It reads only completed hourly bars, so it never repaints during the hour. Mid-zone slope carries no signal at all -- the old "weak bucket" advice was an artifact of a look-ahead bug, corrected on 2026-04-26.'

// 11-position text gauge spanning -150 to +150.
gauge_str(int pos, bool rising) =>
    g = ''
    for i = 0 to 10
        g := g + (i == pos ? (rising ? '▲' : '▼') : '·')
    g

po_gauge_pos = math.round(math.max(0, math.min(10, (math.max(-150, math.min(150, po_1h)) + 150) / 300 * 10)))
po_gauge = gauge_str(po_gauge_pos, po_1h_rising)

bilbo_state_short =
     bull_bilbo_active ? 'BULL BILBO' + st(' ' + pct(po_1h_rising ? S_bilbo_hr : S_bilbo_hf)) :
     bear_bilbo_active ? 'BEAR BILBO' + st(' ' + pct(po_1h_falling ? S_bilbo_lf : S_bilbo_lr)) :
     'no Bilbo'

bilbo_line = 'BEAR ' + po_gauge + ' BULL   ' + str.tostring(po_1h, '#.#') + '  ' + po_zone_name + '\n' + bilbo_state_short + bilbo_tf_note

// ──Compact wording. Same facts, fewer words, so the panel stays narrow. ──
loc_compact =
     close >= upper_1000 ? 'Above +1 ATR' :
     close >= upper_0786 ? '78.6% to +1 ATR' :
     close >= upper_0618 ? 'Gate COMPLETE (61.8%)' :
     close >= upper_0382 ? 'Inside the Gate' :
     close >= upper_trigger  ? 'Trigger to 38.2%' :
     close >= previous_close ? 'Bull trigger box' :
     close >= lower_trigger  ? 'Bear trigger box' :
     close >= lower_0382 ? 'Bear trigger to 38.2%' :
     close >= lower_0618 ? 'Inside the bear Gate' :
     close >= lower_0786 ? 'Bear Gate COMPLETE' :
     close >= lower_1000 ? '78.6% to -1 ATR' :
     'Below -1 ATR'

act_compact =
     not tf_ok_for_signals      ? 'Signals off -- chart is ' + timeframe.period :
     not session_ok_for_signals ? 'Signals off -- outside the session' :
     long_active  ? 'LONG live  ·  exit on close < $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') :
     short_active ? 'SHORT live  ·  exit on close > $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') :
     suppressed_long or suppressed_short ? 'Cross blocked -- see Status' :
     in_bull_trigger_box ? 'Wait for a close above $' + str.tostring(long_line, '#.##') :
     in_bear_trigger_box ? 'Wait for a close below $' + str.tostring(short_line, '#.##') :
     'No setup'

tgt_compact = bias_up ?
     'T1 $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_trig_382_bull) + ')') + '   T2 $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ')') :
     'T1 $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + ')') + '   T2 $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + st(' (' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ')')

stop_compact =
     long_active  ? 'Confirmed close below $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') :
     short_active ? 'Confirmed close above $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') :
     'None active'

status_compact =
     not tf_ok_for_signals      ? 'Signals gated off -- this mode fires on 3m only.' :
     not session_ok_for_signals ? 'Outside the signal session. Levels stay live.' :
     suppressed_long  ? 'Blocked -- ' + (budget_used_long  ? 'long budget used' : 'cooldown ' + str.tostring(math.max(0, cooldown_bars - bars_since_long_exit)) + ' bar(s)') :
     suppressed_short ? 'Blocked -- ' + (budget_used_short ? 'short budget used' : 'cooldown ' + str.tostring(math.max(0, cooldown_bars - bars_since_short_exit)) + ' bar(s)') :
     long_active or short_active ? 'Bar ' + str.tostring(bars_since_trigger) + ' since trigger' + (na(gg_progress) ? '' : '  ·  ' + str.tostring(math.min(100, math.max(0, gg_progress)), '#') + '% through the Gate') :
     'Waiting  ·  ' + mode_short + (stats_valid ? '  ·  stats on' : '  ·  stats off')

// ──SWING LAYOUT ──
// Above a 1-hour chart the intraday machinery cannot be evaluated at all: the
// entry rule needs 3-minute closes, the Bilbo filter needs a readable 1-hour
// series, and the timing ladder is graded by New York trading hours. Rather than
// print six rows explaining what is switched off, the panel drops to the parts
// that remain true at any timeframe -- where price sits, the targets, the stop and
// how far away they are.
swing_layout = chart_mins > 60

swing_status = 'SWING LAYOUT · ' + timeframe.period + ' chart\nIntraday rows hidden -- the 3m entry rules, the 1h Bilbo\nfilter and the ET timing ladder cannot be read above 1h.\nLevels, targets, stops and distances remain valid.' +
     (trading_type == day_trading ? '\nLevel Period is still Day -- Swing or Position would suit this chart.' : '\nLevel Period: ' + trading_mode + '.')

n_rows = compact_mode ? (swing_layout ? 5 : 7) : (swing_layout ? 7 : 14)

var table mk_tbl = na

if not show_milkman_table
    if not na(mk_tbl)
        table.delete(mk_tbl)
        mk_tbl := na
else if na(mk_tbl)
    mk_tbl := table.new(mk_tbl_pos, 2, n_rows,
         border_width = 1,
         border_color = color.new(color.rgb(60, 80, 120), 20),
         frame_color  = color.new(color.rgb(40, 60, 100), 5),
         frame_width  = 2)

if barstate.islast and show_milkman_table and not na(mk_tbl)
    c_key     = color.new(color.rgb(30, 40, 70), 0)
    c_neutral = color.new(color.rgb(22, 28, 50), 0)
    c_mode    = p_milk ? color.new(color.rgb(25, 60, 95), 0) : p_univ ? color.new(color.rgb(60, 50, 90), 0) : color.new(color.rgb(70, 60, 40), 0)
    bilbo_bg  = bull_bilbo_active ? color.new(color.rgb(120, 95, 0), 5) : bear_bilbo_active ? color.new(color.rgb(150, 55, 0), 5) : c_neutral
    gauge_tc  = color.new(bilbo_color, 0)
    hdr_color = long_active ? dash_bull : short_active ? dash_bear : dash_wait

    if compact_mode and swing_layout
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 0, syminfo.ticker, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 0, timeframe.period + '  ·  ' + trading_mode + ' levels  ·  ATR $' + str.tostring(math.round(atr, 2)), bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=mode_line)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 1, 'WHERE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 1, loc_compact, bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=price_zone)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 2, 'TARGETS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 2, tgt_compact, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 70, 30), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=target_note)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 3, 'DISTANCE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 3, dist_note, bgcolor=c_neutral, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 5), text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 4, 'LAYOUT', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 4, 'Swing  ·  ' + timeframe.period + '  ·  intraday rows hidden', bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(60, 55, 90), 10), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=swing_status)
    else if compact_mode
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 0, syminfo.ticker, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 0, timeframe.period + '  ·  ' + mode_short + '  ·  ATR $' + str.tostring(math.round(atr, 2)) + scope_tag, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=mode_line)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 1, 'WHERE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 1, loc_compact, bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=price_zone)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 2, 'DO', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 2, act_compact, bgcolor=entry_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=entry_note + '\n\n' + watch_note)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 3, 'TARGETS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 3, tgt_compact, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 70, 30), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=target_note)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 4, 'STOP', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 4, stop_compact, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(80, 20, 20), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=stop_note)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 5, 'BILBO', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 5, bilbo_line, bgcolor=bilbo_bg, text_color=gauge_tc, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 6, 'STATUS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 6, status_compact, bgcolor=diagnostic_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=diagnostic)
    else if swing_layout
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 0, 'MILKMAN  ' + syminfo.ticker, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 0, timeframe.period + '  |  ' + trading_mode + ' levels  |  ATR $' + str.tostring(math.round(atr, 2)) + '  |  ' + session_tag, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 1, 'MODE', bgcolor=c_mode, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 1, mode_line, bgcolor=c_mode, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 0), text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 2, 'LOCATION', bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 2, price_zone, bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 3, 'TARGETS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 3, target_note, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 70, 30), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 4, 'STOP', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 4, stop_note, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(80, 20, 20), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 5, 'DISTANCE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 5, dist_note, bgcolor=c_neutral, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 5), text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 6, 'LAYOUT', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 6, swing_status, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(60, 55, 90), 10), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
    else
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 0, 'MILKMAN  ' + syminfo.ticker, bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 0, str.tostring(hour_et) + ':' + (minute_et < 10 ? '0' : '') + str.tostring(minute_et) + ' ET · ' + timeframe.period + ' · ATR $' + str.tostring(math.round(atr, 2)) + ' · ' + session_tag + (stats_valid or p_univ ? '' : '\nstats hidden -- off:' + scope_reason), bgcolor=hdr_color, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=st(STAT_VERSION))

        if show_mode_row
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 1, 'MODE', bgcolor=c_mode, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 1, mode_line, bgcolor=c_mode, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 0), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        else
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 1, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 1, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 2, 'LOCATION', bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 2, price_zone, bgcolor=price_zone_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 3, 'WATCH', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 3, watch_note, bgcolor=c_neutral, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 4, 'ENTRY', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 4, entry_note, bgcolor=entry_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 5, 'TARGETS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 5, target_note, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 70, 30), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 6, 'STOP', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 6, stop_note, bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(80, 20, 20), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 7, 'IF STALLS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 7, stall_note, bgcolor=c_neutral, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 8, 'BILBO', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 8, bilbo_line, bgcolor=bilbo_bg, text_color=gauge_tc, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 9, 'BILBO STATE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 9, bilbo_active_text, bgcolor=bilbo_bg, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size, tooltip=BILBO_TIP)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 10, 'CONTEXT', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 10, context_note, bgcolor=bar_counter_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 11, 'TIMING', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 11, time_quality, bgcolor=timing_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)

        if show_distance_row
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 12, 'DISTANCE', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 12, dist_note, bgcolor=c_neutral, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 5), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        else
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 12, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 12, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)

        if show_status_row
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 13, 'STATUS', bgcolor=c_key, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 20), text_size=mk_tbl_size)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 13, diagnostic, bgcolor=diagnostic_color, text_color=color.white, text_size=mk_tbl_size)
        else
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 0, 13, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(mk_tbl, 1, 13, '', bgcolor=c_neutral, text_size=size.tiny)


// ══════════════════PLOT BUDGET ══════════════════
// TradingView allows 64 plot slots per script, and a plot whose colour is a SERIES
// costs two of them. Every level colour here passes through the palette switch, so
// each plot() was costing two slots and the script hit the ceiling at 84.
// The ten levels that carry the system keep their plot() calls, so their history
// still steps across the chart. Everything secondary is drawn as a line object
// instead: identical on screen at the live edge, zero plot slots, and no history.
plot(lower_1000,    color=color.new(e_atr1, 40), linewidth=level_size, title='-1 ATR')
plot(lower_0618,    color=color.new(e_618, 40),  linewidth=level_size, title='-61.8%')
plot(lower_0382,    color=color.new(e_382, 40),  linewidth=level_size, title='-38.2%')
plot(lower_trigger, color=color.new(c_dn, 40),   linewidth=level_size, title='Put Trigger')
plot(previous_close, color=color.new(e_pdc, 40), linewidth=level_size, title='PDC')
plot(upper_trigger, color=color.new(c_up, 40),   linewidth=level_size, title='Call Trigger')
plot(upper_0382,    color=color.new(e_382, 40),  linewidth=level_size, title='+38.2%')
plot(upper_0618,    color=color.new(e_618, 40),  linewidth=level_size, title='+61.8%')
plot(upper_1000,    color=color.new(e_atr1, 40), linewidth=level_size, title='+1 ATR')
plot(show_ema8_10m ? ema8_10m_plot : na, color=color.new(ema8_10m_color, 0), linewidth=ema8_10m_width, title='10m EMA8')

// Secondary levels as line objects -- 50%, 78.6%, the extensions and the buffered
// entry lines.
//
// They are anchored to the bar where the CURRENT level period began and extended to
// the right only. Drawing them with extend.both put a single unbroken line across
// the whole chart, which asserts that the level held throughout history -- it did
// not. Yesterday's 50% sat somewhere else entirely, and on a quarterly period the
// difference is thousands of points. The plotted core levels already step correctly
// through history; these now start where they actually became valid.
var int lvl_start_bar = 0
if na(previous_close[1]) or previous_close != previous_close[1] or atr != atr[1]
    lvl_start_bar := bar_index

var line[] aux_lines = array.new_line()

add_lvl(float y, color c, int w, string sty) =>
    if not na(y)
        array.push(aux_lines, line.new(lvl_start_bar, y, bar_index, y, extend=extend.right, color=c, width=w, style=sty))

if barstate.islast
    if array.size(aux_lines) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(aux_lines) - 1
            line.delete(array.get(aux_lines, i))
        array.clear(aux_lines)

    if eff_show_mid_ext
        add_lvl(upper_0500, color.new(e_500, 40), level_size, line.style_solid)
        add_lvl(lower_0500, color.new(e_500, 40), level_size, line.style_solid)
        add_lvl(upper_0786, color.new(e_786, 40), level_size, line.style_solid)
        add_lvl(lower_0786, color.new(e_786, 40), level_size, line.style_solid)

    if eff_show_ext
        add_lvl(upper_1236, color.new(e_ext, 55),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(upper_1618, color.new(e_618, 55),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(upper_2000, color.new(e_atr1, 55), 1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(upper_2236, color.new(e_ext, 65),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(upper_2618, color.new(e_ext, 65),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(lower_1236, color.new(e_ext, 55),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(lower_1618, color.new(e_618, 55),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(lower_2000, color.new(e_atr1, 55), 1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(lower_2236, color.new(e_ext, 65),  1, line.style_dotted)
        add_lvl(lower_2618, color.new(e_ext, 65),  1, line.style_dotted)

    if has_buffer
        add_lvl(long_line,  color.new(c_up, 55), 1, line.style_dashed)
        add_lvl(short_line, color.new(c_dn, 55), 1, line.style_dashed)

zone_bg =
     show_trigger_box and in_trigger_box ? trigger_box_color :
     show_golden_gate_box and long_active  and close >= upper_0382 and close <= upper_0618 ? gg_bull_shade :
     show_golden_gate_box and short_active and close <= lower_0382 and close >= lower_0618 ? gg_bear_shade :
     na
bgcolor(zone_bg, title='Trigger / Golden Gate Shading')

inside_bull_gate = long_active  and close >= upper_0382 and close <= upper_0618
inside_bear_gate = short_active and close <= lower_0382 and close >= lower_0618

gg_bar_col = not show_gg_barcolor ? na :
     gg_barcolor_mode == 'Entry bar only' ? (entry_long_gg ? e_gg_bull : entry_short_gg ? e_gg_bear : na) :
     (inside_bull_gate ? e_gg_bull : inside_bear_gate ? e_gg_bear : na)

barcolor(gg_bar_col, title='Golden Gate Candle')

var line ln_pdh = na
var line ln_pdl = na
var line ln_pmh = na
var line ln_pml = na
if not na(ln_pdh)
    line.delete(ln_pdh)
if not na(ln_pdl)
    line.delete(ln_pdl)
if not na(ln_pmh)
    line.delete(ln_pmh)
if not na(ln_pml)
    line.delete(ln_pml)
if barstate.islast
    if eff_show_pdh_pdl and not na(pdh)
        ln_pdh := line.new(lvl_start_bar, pdh, bar_index, pdh, extend=extend.right, color=pdh_color, width=session_level_size, style=line.style_dashed)
    if eff_show_pdh_pdl and not na(pdl)
        ln_pdl := line.new(lvl_start_bar, pdl, bar_index, pdl, extend=extend.right, color=pdl_color, width=session_level_size, style=line.style_dashed)
    if eff_show_pmh_pml and not na(pm_high)
        ln_pmh := line.new(sess_start_bar, pm_high, bar_index, pm_high, extend=extend.right, color=pmh_color, width=session_level_size, style=line.style_dotted)
    if eff_show_pmh_pml and not na(pm_low)
        ln_pml := line.new(sess_start_bar, pm_low, bar_index, pm_low, extend=extend.right, color=pml_color, width=session_level_size, style=line.style_dotted)


// ══════════════════════════════LABELS ══════════════════════════════
var label ref_close_label = na
var label targetLabel = na
var label stopLabel   = na
var label ema8_label  = na
var label fib0382u = na
var label fib0500u = na
var label fib0618u = na
var label fib0786u = na
var label fib1000u = na
var label fib1236u = na
var label fib1618u = na
var label fib2000u = na
var label fib2236u = na
var label fib2618u = na
var label fib0382d = na
var label fib0500d = na
var label fib0618d = na
var label fib0786d = na
var label fib1000d = na
var label fib1236d = na
var label fib1618d = na
var label fib2000d = na
var label fib2236d = na
var label fib2618d = na
var label prob_trig_u = na
var label prob_382_u  = na
var label prob_618_u  = na
var label prob_786_u  = na
var label prob_atr1_u = na
var label prob_trig_d = na
var label prob_382_d  = na
var label prob_618_d  = na
var label prob_786_d  = na
var label prob_atr1_d = na
var label gg_zone_label_u = na
var label gg_zone_label_d = na
var label pdh_label = na
var label pdl_label = na
var label pmh_label = na
var label pml_label = na

lab_x = bar_index + label_right_offset

if barstate.islast
    label.delete(ref_close_label)
    label.delete(targetLabel)
    label.delete(stopLabel)
    label.delete(ema8_label)
    label.delete(fib0382u)
    label.delete(fib0500u)
    label.delete(fib0618u)
    label.delete(fib0786u)
    label.delete(fib1000u)
    label.delete(fib1236u)
    label.delete(fib1618u)
    label.delete(fib2000u)
    label.delete(fib2236u)
    label.delete(fib2618u)
    label.delete(fib0382d)
    label.delete(fib0500d)
    label.delete(fib0618d)
    label.delete(fib0786d)
    label.delete(fib1000d)
    label.delete(fib1236d)
    label.delete(fib1618d)
    label.delete(fib2000d)
    label.delete(fib2236d)
    label.delete(fib2618d)
    label.delete(prob_trig_u)
    label.delete(prob_382_u)
    label.delete(prob_618_u)
    label.delete(prob_786_u)
    label.delete(prob_atr1_u)
    label.delete(prob_trig_d)
    label.delete(prob_382_d)
    label.delete(prob_618_d)
    label.delete(prob_786_d)
    label.delete(prob_atr1_d)
    label.delete(gg_zone_label_u)
    label.delete(gg_zone_label_d)
    label.delete(pdh_label)
    label.delete(pdl_label)
    label.delete(pmh_label)
    label.delete(pml_label)

    ref_close_label := label.new(lab_x, previous_close, 'PDC: $' + str.tostring(previous_close, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_pdc, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=sess_lbl_sz)

    if show_ema8_10m and show_ema8_10m_label and not na(ema8_10m_plot)
        ema8_label := label.new(lab_x, ema8_10m_plot, '10m EMA8 $' + str.tostring(ema8_10m_plot, '#.##') + (htf_10m_ok ? '' : ' (approx)'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(ema8_10m_color, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=sess_lbl_sz)

    if show_session_labels
        if eff_show_pdh_pdl and not na(pdh)
            pdh_label := label.new(lab_x, pdh, 'PDH $' + str.tostring(pdh, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(pdh_color, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        if eff_show_pdh_pdl and not na(pdl)
            pdl_label := label.new(lab_x, pdl, 'PDL $' + str.tostring(pdl, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(pdl_color, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        if eff_show_pmh_pml and not na(pm_high)
            pmh_label := label.new(lab_x, pm_high, 'PMH $' + str.tostring(pm_high, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(pmh_color, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        if eff_show_pmh_pml and not na(pm_low)
            pml_label := label.new(lab_x, pm_low, 'PML $' + str.tostring(pm_low, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(pml_color, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)

    if show_fib_labels
        fib0382u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0382, '38.2%  $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_382, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        fib0382d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0382, '38.2%  $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_382, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        fib0618u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0618, 'GATE TARGET 61.8%  $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_618, 20), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        fib0618d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0618, 'GATE TARGET 61.8%  $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_618, 20), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        fib1000u := label.new(lab_x, upper_1000, '+1 ATR  $' + str.tostring(upper_1000, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_atr1, 20), textcolor=color.black, size=sess_lbl_sz)
        fib1000d := label.new(lab_x, lower_1000, '-1 ATR  $' + str.tostring(lower_1000, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_atr1, 20), textcolor=color.black, size=sess_lbl_sz)

        if eff_show_mid_ext
            fib0786u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0786, '78.6%  $' + str.tostring(upper_0786, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_786, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib0786d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0786, '78.6%  $' + str.tostring(lower_0786, '#.##'), style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(e_786, 30), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)

        if eff_show_ext
            fib1236u := label.new(lab_x, upper_1236, '123.6%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib1618u := label.new(lab_x, upper_1618, '161.8%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_618, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2000u := label.new(lab_x, upper_2000, '+2 ATR', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_atr1, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2236u := label.new(lab_x, upper_2236, '223.6%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2618u := label.new(lab_x, upper_2618, '261.8%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib1236d := label.new(lab_x, lower_1236, '123.6%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib1618d := label.new(lab_x, lower_1618, '161.8%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_618, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2000d := label.new(lab_x, lower_2000, '-2 ATR', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_atr1, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2236d := label.new(lab_x, lower_2236, '223.6%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)
            fib2618d := label.new(lab_x, lower_2618, '261.8%', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(e_ext, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=sess_lbl_sz)

    if label_mode != 'Off'

        trig_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'CALL TRIGGER  $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + '  |  confirmed close above = entry' + st('  |  ' + pct(S_call_conf_382) + ' reach 38.2% same day  |  back below -> ' + pct(S_call_invalidated)) + '  |  close back below = EXIT' :
             'CALL TRIGGER  $' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + '  (' + trig_pct_txt + ')' + '\n' +
             'The entry gate. Price must CLOSE a confirmed candle above this level -- a touch or a wick does not count.' + '\n' +
             st('After a confirmed close above: ' + pct(S_call_conf_382) + ' reach 38.2% the same day.' + '\n' +
                 'If price then closes back BELOW this line, that falls to ' + pct(S_call_invalidated) + '. The invalidation filter is the whole edge.' + '\n' +
                 'The median winner reaches 38.2% in ' + str.tostring(S_median_mins_382) + ' minutes -- the MEDIAN, so half take longer. There is no deadline.') +
             (stats_valid ? '' : 'Statistics are off in this mode. The mechanic is unchanged: enter on a confirmed close through the level, exit on a confirmed close back through it.')
        prob_trig_u := label.new(lab_x, upper_trigger, trig_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        gg_382_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'GATE OPENS  $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_trig_382_bull) + ' reach here  |  to 61.8%: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bull) + '  |  best entry = pullback to trigger (' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bull) + ')') :
             'GOLDEN GATE OPENS  $' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + '  (38.2% ATR)' + '\n' +
             'The trade corridor runs from here to 61.8%.' + '\n' +
             st(pct(S_trig_382_bull) + ' of bull trigger days reach here. From here to 61.8%: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bull) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Entry options, ranked by EV:' + '\n' +
                 '  1. Pullback to the TRIGGER -- ' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bull) + ', appears on 63% of setups. Best EV.' + '\n' +
                 '  2. Immediate at 38.2% -- ' + pct(S_entry_imm_bull) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_imm_bull) + '.' + '\n' +
                 '  3. Pullback to the 10-MINUTE EMA8 -- ' + pct(S_entry_ema8_bull) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_ema8_bull) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Do NOT wait for the 50% midpoint -- fresh entries there are ' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bull) + '.') +
             (stats_valid ? '' : 'Entry options: pullback to the trigger, immediate at 38.2%, or a pullback to the 10-minute EMA8. Avoid fresh entries at the 50% midpoint.')
        prob_382_u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0382, gg_382_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        if eff_show_mid_ext
            mid_500_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
                 '50% MIDPOINT  $' + str.tostring(upper_0500, '#.##') + '  |  do NOT enter fresh' + st(' (' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bull) + ')') + '  |  already in: hold, stop at the trigger' :
                 '50% MIDPOINT  $' + str.tostring(upper_0500, '#.##') + '\n' +
                 'Halfway through the Gate. Do NOT enter fresh here' + st(' -- measured EV is ' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bull)) + '. Reward left to 61.8% is smaller than the risk back to the trigger.' + '\n' +
                 'Already in: hold. Stop stays a confirmed close back through the trigger.'
            fib0500u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0500, mid_500_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

            mid_500_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
                 '50% MIDPOINT  $' + str.tostring(lower_0500, '#.##') + '  |  do NOT enter fresh' + st(' (' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bear) + ')') + '  |  already in: hold, stop at the trigger' :
                 '50% MIDPOINT  $' + str.tostring(lower_0500, '#.##') + '\n' +
                 'Halfway through the bear Gate. Do NOT enter fresh here' + st(' -- measured EV is ' + ev(S_ev_mid50_bear)) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Already in: hold. Stop stays a confirmed close back through the trigger.'
            fib0500d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0500, mid_500_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

            ext_786_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
                 'POST-GATE  $' + str.tostring(upper_0786, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_l618_786_bull) + ' of 61.8% touches reach here  |  to +1 ATR: ' + pct(S_l786_atr_bull)) + '  |  trail to 61.8%' :
                 'POST-GATE EXTENSION  $' + str.tostring(upper_0786, '#.##') + '  (78.6% ATR)' + '\n' +
                 'Beyond the Gate. Trail your stop up to 61.8% on arrival. Do not add here.' + '\n' +
                 st(pct(S_l618_786_bull) + ' of 61.8% touches reach here. From here to the full ATR: ' + pct(S_l786_atr_bull) + '.')
            prob_786_u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0786, ext_786_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

            ext_786_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
                 'POST-GATE  $' + str.tostring(lower_0786, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_l618_786_bear) + ' of 61.8% touches reach here  |  to -1 ATR: ' + pct(S_l786_atr_bear)) + '  |  trail to 61.8%' :
                 'POST-GATE EXTENSION  $' + str.tostring(lower_0786, '#.##') + '  (78.6% ATR)' + '\n' +
                 'Beyond the bear Gate. Trail your stop to 61.8% on arrival. Do not add here.' + '\n' +
                 st(pct(S_l618_786_bear) + ' of 61.8% touches reach here. From here to the full ATR: ' + pct(S_l786_atr_bear) + '.')
            prob_786_d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0786, ext_786_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        gg_618_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'GATE TARGET  $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' baseline (Bilbo ' + pct(S_bilbo_hr) + '/' + pct(S_bilbo_hf) + ')') + '  |  scale out 50%+' :
             'GOLDEN GATE TARGET  $' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + '  (61.8% ATR)' + '\n' +
             'The primary target. The Gate completes here. Scale out at least half.' + '\n' +
             st('Bull baseline: ' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' (n=3,421). With Bilbo at entry: High+Rising ' + pct(S_bilbo_hr) + ', High+Falling ' + pct(S_bilbo_hf) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'No Bilbo? From here to 78.6% is ' + pct(S_base_786_bull) + '. Bilbo? ' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bull) + ' to 78.6% and ' + pct(S_bilbo_atr_bull) + ' to +1 ATR.')
        prob_618_u := label.new(lab_x, upper_0618, gg_618_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        atr1_u_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'FULL ATR  $' + str.tostring(upper_1000, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_day_atr_bull) + ' of ALL days reach here') + '  |  take full profits' :
             'FULL ATR  $' + str.tostring(upper_1000, '#.##') + '  (+1 ATR)' + '\n' +
             'Rare territory.' + st(' ' + pct(S_day_atr_bull) + ' of all trading days reach the full upside ATR.') + '\n' +
             'Take full profits. There is no researched edge beyond this level. Mean reversion is the base case.'
        prob_atr1_u := label.new(lab_x, upper_1000, atr1_u_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        trig_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'PUT TRIGGER  $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + '  |  confirmed close below = entry' + st('  |  trigger to 38.2%: ' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + '  |  no put-side 3m study') :
             'PUT TRIGGER  $' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + '  (' + trig_pct_txt + ')' + '\n' +
             'The short-side entry gate. Price must CLOSE a confirmed candle below this level.' + '\n' +
             st('IMPORTANT: the 3-minute close study was run on CALLS ONLY. The ' + pct(S_call_conf_382) + ' / ' + pct(S_call_invalidated) + ' pair does NOT apply here.' + '\n' +
                 'Measured on the bear side: trigger to 38.2% is ' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + ', trigger holding to Gate completion is ' + pct(S_trig_holds_bear) + ' (10m closes).' + '\n') +
             'Exit rule: a confirmed close back above this line ends the setup.'
        prob_trig_d := label.new(lab_x, lower_trigger, trig_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        gg_382_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'GATE OPENS  $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_trig_382_bear) + ' reach here  |  to 61.8%: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bear) + '  |  best entry = pullback to trigger (' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bear) + ')') :
             'GOLDEN GATE OPENS  $' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + '  (38.2% ATR)' + '\n' +
             'The bear trade corridor runs from here to 61.8%.' + '\n' +
             st(pct(S_trig_382_bear) + ' of bear trigger days reach here. From here to 61.8%: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bear) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Entry options, ranked by EV:' + '\n' +
                 '  1. Pullback to the TRIGGER -- ' + ev(S_ev_trigpb_bear) + ', appears on 70% of setups. Best EV.' + '\n' +
                 '  2. Immediate at 38.2% -- ' + pct(S_entry_imm_bear) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_imm_bear) + '.' + '\n' +
                 '  3. Bounce to the 10-MINUTE EMA8 -- ' + pct(S_entry_ema8_bear) + ', ' + ev(S_ev_ema8_bear) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Bilbo (1h PO Low+Falling) lifts Gate completion to ' + pct(S_bilbo_lf) + ' -- the strongest state in the system.')
        prob_382_d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0382, gg_382_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        gg_618_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'GATE TARGET  $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ' baseline (Bilbo ' + pct(S_bilbo_lf) + '/' + pct(S_bilbo_lr) + ')') + '  |  scale out 50%+' :
             'GOLDEN GATE TARGET  $' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + '  (61.8% ATR)' + '\n' +
             'The primary short-side target. Scale out at least half. Selling cascades end abruptly.' + '\n' +
             st('Bear baseline: ' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ' (n=3,196). With Bilbo at entry: Low+Falling ' + pct(S_bilbo_lf) + ', Low+Rising ' + pct(S_bilbo_lr) + '.' + '\n' +
                 'Bilbo? ' + pct(S_bilbo_786_bear) + ' reach 78.6% and ' + pct(S_bilbo_atr_bear) + ' reach -1 ATR. No Bilbo: ' + pct(S_base_786_bear) + ' to 78.6%.')
        prob_618_d := label.new(lab_x, lower_0618, gg_618_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

        atr1_d_text = label_mode == 'Summary' ?
             'FULL ATR  $' + str.tostring(lower_1000, '#.##') + st('  |  ' + pct(S_day_atr_bear) + ' of ALL days reach here') + '  |  take full profits' :
             'FULL ATR  $' + str.tostring(lower_1000, '#.##') + '  (-1 ATR)' + '\n' +
             'Rare territory.' + st(' ' + pct(S_day_atr_bear) + ' of all trading days reach the full downside ATR.') + '\n' +
             'Take full profits. Selling cascades end without warning. A mean reversion back toward PDC is the next setup, not a continued short.'
        prob_atr1_d := label.new(lab_x, lower_1000, atr1_d_text, style=label.style_label_left, color=label_bg_color, textcolor=label_text_color, size=lbl_sz)

    if show_golden_gate_box
        if long_active
            gg_mid_bull = (upper_0382 + upper_0618) / 2
            gg_zone_label_u := label.new(lab_x, gg_mid_bull,
                 'THE GOLDEN GATE  (' + str.tostring(upper_0382, '#.##') + ' to ' + str.tostring(upper_0618, '#.##') + ')' + '\n' +
                 st('Bull completion: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bull) + ' from 38.2%, ' + pct(S_gg_base_bull) + ' from the trigger day.' + '\n') +
                 'WHILE INSIDE: hold. The only stop is a confirmed close BELOW the call trigger.' + '\n' +
                 'EXITS TOP: scale out, trail to 38.2%.' + st(' ' + pct(S_l618_786_bull) + ' continue to 78.6%.') + '\n' +
                 'EXITS BOTTOM: if the trigger also breaks, the setup has failed -- exit.',
                 style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(color.green, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.small)

        if short_active
            gg_mid_bear = (lower_0382 + lower_0618) / 2
            gg_zone_label_d := label.new(lab_x, gg_mid_bear,
                 'THE GOLDEN GATE  (' + str.tostring(lower_0382, '#.##') + ' to ' + str.tostring(lower_0618, '#.##') + ')' + '\n' +
                 st('Bear completion: ' + pct(S_l382_618_bear) + ' from 38.2%, ' + pct(S_gg_base_bear) + ' from the trigger day.' + '\n') +
                 'WHILE INSIDE: hold. The only stop is a confirmed close ABOVE the put trigger.' + '\n' +
                 'EXITS BOTTOM: scale out, trail to 38.2%.' + st(' Bilbo entries: ' + pct(S_bilbo_atr_bear) + ' reach full ATR.') + '\n' +
                 'EXITS TOP: if the trigger also breaks, the setup has failed -- exit.',
                 style=label.style_label_right, color=color.new(color.red, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.small)

    if show_target_stop
        long_target  = previous_close + tp_multiplier * atr
        short_target = previous_close - tp_multiplier * atr
        tp_name = str.tostring(tp_multiplier) + ' ATR (runner -- not the Gate target)'

        if long_active
            targetLabel := label.new(lab_x, long_target, 'RUNNER TARGET\n$' + str.tostring(long_target, '#.##') + '\n' + tp_name, style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(color.green, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=tp_label_size_val)
            stopLabel   := label.new(lab_x, upper_trigger, 'STOP\n$' + str.tostring(upper_trigger, '#.##') + '\nconfirmed close below', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=tp_label_size_val)

        if short_active
            targetLabel := label.new(lab_x, short_target, 'RUNNER TARGET\n$' + str.tostring(short_target, '#.##') + '\n' + tp_name, style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=tp_label_size_val)
            stopLabel   := label.new(lab_x, lower_trigger, 'STOP\n$' + str.tostring(lower_trigger, '#.##') + '\nconfirmed close above', style=label.style_label_left, color=color.new(color.green, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=tp_label_size_val)


// ══════════════════════════════CHART MARKERS ══════════════════════════════
plotshape(show_pdc_reclaim and pdc_reclaim_bull, title='PDC Reclaim Bull',
     style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(c_up, 0), size=size.tiny, text='PDC', textcolor=color.white)
plotshape(show_pdc_reclaim and pdc_reclaim_bear, title='PDC Reclaim Bear',
     style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(c_dn, 0), size=size.tiny, text='PDC', textcolor=color.white)

plotshape(show_trigger_markers and entry_long_trigger, title='ENTER Long',
     style=shape.labelup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(c_up, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='ENTER')
plotshape(show_trigger_markers and entry_short_trigger, title='ENTER Short',
     style=shape.labeldown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(c_dn, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='ENTER')

plotshape(show_gg_markers and entry_long_gg, title='Gate Open Long',
     style=shape.diamond, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.green, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, text='GG')
plotshape(show_gg_markers and entry_short_gg, title='Gate Open Short',
     style=shape.diamond, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, text='GG')

plotshape(show_tpb_markers and entry_long_trigpb, title='T-PB Long',
     style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.aqua, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='T-PB')
plotshape(show_tpb_markers and entry_short_trigpb, title='T-PB Short',
     style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.fuchsia, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='T-PB')

plotshape(show_ema8_markers and entry_long_ema8, title='EMA8 Pullback Long',
     style=shape.circle, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.lime, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='EMA8')
plotshape(show_ema8_markers and entry_short_ema8, title='EMA8 Pullback Short',
     style=shape.circle, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.orange, 0), textcolor=color.black, size=size.tiny, text='EMA8')

plotshape(show_exit_markers and exit_long, title='EXIT Long',
     style=shape.xcross, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, text='EXIT')
plotshape(show_exit_markers and exit_short, title='EXIT Short',
     style=shape.xcross, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny, text='EXIT')


// ══════════════════════════════ALERTS ══════════════════════════════
// FIX 6: mechanics only. alertcondition text is fixed when the script compiles, so
// it cannot know the symbol, timeframe or mode. Quoting SPY percentages here would
// be wrong on every other market. The probabilities live in the dashboard.
alertcondition(entry_long_trigger and alert_long, title='ENTER Long (trigger)',
     message='ticker interval -- LONG entry. Confirmed close above the call trigger. Stop: a confirmed close back below it.')
alertcondition(entry_short_trigger and alert_short, title='ENTER Short (trigger)',
     message='ticker interval -- SHORT entry. Confirmed close below the put trigger. Stop: a confirmed close back above it.')
alertcondition(exit_long, title='EXIT Long',
     message='ticker interval -- EXIT LONG. Confirmed close back below the call trigger. The setup is invalidated.')
alertcondition(exit_short, title='EXIT Short',
     message='ticker interval -- EXIT SHORT. Confirmed close back above the put trigger. The setup is invalidated.')
alertcondition(entry_long_gg, title='Gate Open Long (38.2%)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bull Golden Gate open at 38.2%. Target 61.8%. Stop: a confirmed close below the trigger.')
alertcondition(entry_short_gg, title='Gate Open Short (38.2%)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bear Golden Gate open at 38.2%. Target 61.8%. Stop: a confirmed close above the trigger.')
alertcondition(entry_long_trigpb, title='T-PB Long (trigger pullback)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bull pullback to the trigger, with the Gate already open. Target 61.8%.')
alertcondition(entry_short_trigpb, title='T-PB Short (trigger pullback)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bear pullback to the trigger, with the Gate already open. Target 61.8%.')
alertcondition(entry_long_ema8, title='EMA8 Pullback Long',
     message='ticker interval -- Bull pullback to the 10-minute EMA8 inside the Gate. Target 61.8%.')
alertcondition(entry_short_ema8, title='EMA8 Pullback Short',
     message='ticker interval -- Bear bounce to the 10-minute EMA8 inside the Gate. Target 61.8%.')
alertcondition(signal_close and close > upper_0618 and close[1] <= upper_0618, title='Gate Complete Long (61.8%)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bull Golden Gate complete at 61.8%. Scale out and trail to 38.2%.')
alertcondition(signal_close and close < lower_0618 and close[1] >= lower_0618, title='Gate Complete Short (61.8%)',
     message='ticker interval -- Bear Golden Gate complete at 61.8%. Scale out and trail to 38.2%.')
alertcondition(pdc_reclaim_bull, title='PDC Reclaim Bull',
     message='ticker interval -- Previous close reclaimed from the bear box on a first-hour 10m close. Consider flipping long.')
alertcondition(pdc_reclaim_bear, title='PDC Reclaim Bear',
     message='ticker interval -- Previous close lost from the bull box on a first-hour 10m close. Consider flipping short.')


// ══════════════════════════════LEGEND / CHEAT SHEET ══════════════════════════════
legend_pos = legend_position == 'Top Left' ? position.top_left : legend_position == 'Top Right' ? position.top_right : legend_position == 'Bottom Left' ? position.bottom_left : position.bottom_right

var table lg = na
lg_k = color.new(color.rgb(30, 40, 70), 0)
lg_v = color.new(color.rgb(20, 25, 45), 0)

// Declared at global scope: Pine does not permit a function definition inside an if.
lg_row(int r, string k, string v) =>
    table.cell(lg, 0, r, k, bgcolor=lg_k, text_color=color.new(color.silver, 10), text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)
    table.cell(lg, 1, r, v, bgcolor=lg_v, text_color=color.white, text_size=size.tiny, text_halign=text.align_left)

if not show_legend
    if not na(lg)
        table.delete(lg)
        lg := na
else if na(lg)
    lg := table.new(legend_pos, 2, 15, border_width=1,
         border_color=color.new(color.rgb(60, 80, 120), 30),
         frame_color=color.new(color.rgb(40, 60, 100), 10), frame_width=1)

if barstate.islast and show_legend and not na(lg)
    table.cell(lg, 0, 0, 'HOW TO READ THIS', bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 35, 70), 0), text_color=color.white, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(lg, 1, 0, 'Levels are the previous close ± a share of the ATR', bgcolor=color.new(color.rgb(20, 35, 70), 0), text_color=color.new(color.silver, 5), text_size=size.tiny)

    lg_row(1,  'Mode: ' + mode_short, p_milk ? 'The researched SPY/SPX configuration. Percentages shown only in that exact scope.' :
         p_univ ? 'Same structure, any market. Percentages hidden -- they were never measured outside SPY.' :
         'Your own rules, set under Signal Rules.')
    lg_row(2,  'PDC',            'Previous period close. Every level is measured from it.')
    lg_row(3,  'Trigger',        'The entry gate at ' + trig_pct_txt + ' either side of PDC. A CONFIRMED close beyond it starts the trade. A wick does not count.')
    lg_row(4,  '38.2%',          'The Golden Gate opens. First target, and the second-best place to enter.')
    lg_row(5,  '50%',            'Midpoint. Never enter fresh here -- the risk/reward is negative. Hold if already in.')
    lg_row(6,  '61.8%',          'THE GATE TARGET. The main objective. Scale out at least half.')
    lg_row(7,  '78.6% / 1 ATR',  'Extension. Trail the stop, do not add. A full ATR move is rare.')
    lg_row(8,  'ENTER / EXIT',   'ENTER = confirmed close through the trigger. EXIT = confirmed close back through it. The exit is the edge.')
    lg_row(9,  'GG / T-PB / EMA8','Entry types: Gate open at 38.2%, pullback to the trigger (best odds), pullback to the 10-minute EMA8.')
    lg_row(10, 'Gold candle',    'The bar that opened the Golden Gate.')
    lg_row(11, 'BILBO',          'A 1-hour Phase Oscillator filter. In the outer zones the setup historically performed better.')
    lg_row(12, 'Percentages',    'Measured on SPY, 3-minute closes, regular hours, 2000-2025. Hidden on any other chart or mode.')
    lg_row(13, 'STATUS row',     'Always explains why no signal is showing -- gated off, blocked, degraded timeframe, or simply waiting.')
    lg_row(14, 'Swing trading',  'Outside Milkman mode, set Level Period to Swing or Position: the same structure built from monthly or quarterly ranges, useful on liquid tickers with a 4h or daily chart. Less reliable on thin small-cap crypto.')
